et", "value": "Bhugaon / Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100076652", "Bavdhan-Bhugaon Scenic Corridor", "PLUS Home Zero Wastage Design"]', 'P52100076652', 11200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/3PxeuRrw4eYgQ0cWzgG2Kgbdw4BwwSRi226tv5os.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/floorplans/mvhwtyw9-615q1s.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/51d9ac0e-fce4-4d62-92ed-4c317ba01752/gallery/mvwj57mu-3kuy7j.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/51d9ac0e-fce4-4d62-92ed-4c317ba01752/gallery/mvwj57oz-4h89nf.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/51d9ac0e-fce4-4d62-92ed-4c317ba01752/gallery/mvwj57r4-dkeeiv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5028, 73.7381, '[{"type": "2 BHK Comfort", "carpetArea": "727 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹80 L"}, {"type": "2 BHK Grande", "carpetArea": "864 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹98 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK Royal", "carpetArea": "1150 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.43 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK Imperial", "carpetArea": "1536 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.85 Cr"}]', '["Scenic Valley & Foothills Setting in Bhugaon", "Minutes from Chandani Chowk & Bavdhan", "Multi-Tier Clubhouse & Heated Swimming Pool", "Organic Herb Gardens & Forest Walking Trails", "Zero Commission Direct Deal"]', '[{"question": "Where is Rohan Saroha located?", "answer": "Rohan Saroha is located at Bhugaon, Mulshi, Pune."}, {"question": "What is the price of Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "Prices at Rohan Saroha range from ₹ 87.00 Lac – 1.66 Cr (agreement value). Homes are available as 2, 3, 4 BHK."}, {"question": "Which configurations are available at Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "The project offers 2, 3, 4 BHK homes. Carpet areas range from 836 – 1,535 sq.ft."}, {"question": "What is the RERA number of Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "The RERA registration number of Rohan Saroha is P52100076652."}, {"question": "When is the possession of Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "Possession is expected by Sep 2028, as per the RERA registration."}, {"question": "Who is the developer of Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "Rohan Saroha is developed by Rohan Builders. The developer has been in real estate since 1993."}, {"question": "How many floors does Rohan Saroha have?", "answer": "The project has 15 floors. It is spread across 5.76 acres."}, {"question": "What amenities does Rohan Saroha offer?", "answer": "Amenities include Amphitheater, Banquet Hall, Cafeteria, Club house, Fitness Corner, Gym, Jogging Track, Kids Play Area and more."}, {"question": "Which banks give home loans for Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "Home loans are available from Aditya Birla Capital, Axis Bank Home Loan, Bajaj Finserv, Bank of Baroda, Citi Bank, among others. Our team can help you compare offers."}, {"question": "How do I book a site visit to Rohan Saroha?", "answer": "Use \"Schedule Site Visit\" on this page or call +91 93108 63636. PROPSMART REALTY arranges a free guided visit, with pick-up on request."}]', '');
