4 Kalpavriksha MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, 24 Kalpavriksha is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002502854. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at 24 Kalpavriksha?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-the-arista', 'The Arista', 'the-arista', 'b-the-skies-group', 'Pimple Nilakh', '₹1.87 Cr - ₹4.25 Cr', '₹1.87 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'August 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnbi8-2g2sm4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnbi8-2g2sm4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nBIFK5yY27v8iGeOPunLCcGZJMSxZp8NlvxZwRKD.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774955181630535411.jpeg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/UPzmG4euaO1BOdmqRNMXOBWt8x0Bj8yXV84daLnk.webp"]', 'The Arista by Cristallo Infra LLP is a single-tower residential project in Vishal Nagar, Pimple Nilakh, Pune 411027, on a land parcel of about 0.66 acre (around 27,000 sq ft). It offers 3 BHK apartments of 1,210 to 1,605 sq ft carpet, 4 BHK apartments of 1,669 to 1,994 sq ft carpet, and duplex Sky Villas of 2,153 sq ft (3 BHK) and 2,704 sq ft (4 BHK) carpet. Listed prices start around Rs 1.87 crore and go up to about Rs 4.25 crore, subject to charges, so confirm current rates with the sales team. Amenities include a rooftop infinity-edge pool, gymnasium, yoga deck, mini theatre, mini squash court, multipurpose court, party lawn, indoor games area, children''s play area and a library and co-working space. The project is close to Kalewadi Main Road (about 0.5 km), Hopscotch Pre School and Sakhi Nursing Home (about 0.2 km each), Fortuna Business Center (about 1.2 km) and Kokane Chowk (about 2.5 km). It is registered with MahaRERA under number P52100055954, with RERA possession in August 2027. Download the brochure or book a site visit through Pune Home.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055954"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.87 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "August 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Nilakh, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055954", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Nilakh Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055954', 15454, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnbi8-2g2sm4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnc3y-3uy8yq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghncs9-5po1ll.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghndks-96sb2e.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghneeg-bj150b.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/a6dc0c88-7cbe-43d4-9bc3-4158339ebef6/gallery/mvghnfcm-4bhf23.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.581, 73.7937, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1000 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.87 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1809 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹4.25 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"question": "Where is The Arista located?", "answer": "The Arista is strategically located in prime Pimple Nilakh, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in The Arista?", "answer": "Residences in The Arista start from ₹1.87 Cr - ₹4.25 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in The Arista?", "answer": "The Arista offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is The Arista MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, The Arista is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100055954. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at The Arista?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Library, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-avani-amara', 'Avani Amara', 'avani-amara', 'b-avani-housing', 'Mundhwa', '₹75.00 L - ₹1.30 Cr', '₹75.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxir-2deba1.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxir-2deba1.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/k0DKtRzvGyo3jMbyF5lDnXQFFY421WAIwDkXgXvJ.webp', '["/images/projects/anp-autograph/floor-plan-3bhk.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/XDKgaRfa1mQu0BrmAy2NCDrLJUSJqdBCMUuH63dB.webp"]', 'Avani Amara is a residential project by Avani Housing, developed with Bansall, in Keshav Nagar, Mundhwa, Pune, opposite the Godrej substation (Sr. No. 9 to 14/1/49). Spread over about 2 acres, it has five connected towers of ground plus 20 floors with 2 and 3 BHK homes that the developer calls Signature Homes. Wing A has 2 BHK homes of 800 to 802 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,054 to 1,055 sq ft, and Wing B has compact 2 BHK homes, with a bedroom and a study room, of 609 to 638 sq ft. These are total carpet areas, including the balcony. All-inclusive prices start at ₹75 lakh for a 2 BHK and ₹1.30 crore for a 3 BHK. More than 30 amenities are spread across landscaped zones and the rooftop: a clubhouse, swimming pool with deck, multipurpose sports court, open-air gym and fitness club, yoga and meditation zone, jogging track, climbing walls, children''s and toddlers'' play areas, a dog park, party lawn with buffet and barbecue areas, amphitheatre seating, a stargazing area, co-working hub, library and crèche. Homes have 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a branded biometric lock on the main door, UPVC sliding windows, AC points in the living room and every bedroom and 5 A generator backup, and the project adds rainwater harvesting, a sewage treatment plant, a heat pump for central hot water, solar lighting in common areas and provision for EV charging. Kharadi is about 4 km away, Hadapsar 5.3 km, Koregaon Park 6.5 km, Pune Station 9.5 km and Pune Airport 11 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PR1260002501370).', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501370"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹75 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501370", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100061370', 12315, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxir-2deba1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxm7-55b00d.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxoh-4g2w0c.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxqn-bvqazr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxsx-bmn1u3.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f64dd8a4-68e0-46c6-aebf-1d8e29be3e5e/gallery/mvtitxux-8929pn.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5366, 73.9181, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "739 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹75 L - ₹94 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "999 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.30 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"question": "Where is Avani Amara located?", "answer": "Avani Amara is strategically located in prime Mundhwa, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Avani Amara?", "answer": "Residences in Avani Amara start from ₹75 L - ₹1.30 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Avani Amara?", "answer": "Avani Amara offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Avani Amara MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Avani Amara is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002501370. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Avani Amara?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Library, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-godrej-skyline', 'Godrej Skyline', 'godrej-skyline', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.49 Cr - ₹6.09 Cr', '₹3.49 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '30 November 2029', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kar-64xaj6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kar-64xaj6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/P8QVGC64Hk3A8KQdGVAySetrgtwaNp3vYfH4zEou.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/HlZPHQBAei2owiayJmxJZhkdXYVI8emWvLduM451.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16764376981430699028.jpg"]', 'Godrej Skyline is a luxury residential development by Godrej Properties in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, Pune, on a 3.75-acre land parcel at the corner of a 30 m and an 18 m wide road. Four towers rise to B + G + UG + 5 podium levels + 29 floors, and each tower holds only one home type: Towers 1 and 4 are entirely 3 BHK with just three homes per floor, and Towers 2 and 3 are entirely 4 BHK with just two homes per floor. Towers 1 and 2 form the Luxury series, with imported marble in the living, dining and bedrooms, TOTO fittings and 3 BHK homes of 1,549 to 1,586 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 2,397 sq ft. Towers 3 and 4 form the Windsor series, with 3 BHK homes of 1,349 to 1,363 sq ft and 4 BHK homes of 1,808 to 1,811 sq ft (total RERA area, including balconies). All-inclusive prices start at ₹3.49 crore for a Windsor 3 BHK, ₹4.05 crore for a Luxury 3 BHK, ₹4.69 crore for a Windsor 4 BHK and ₹6.09 crore for a Luxury 4 BHK. Living and dining rooms run up to 32 ft 10 in wide in the Tower 2 4 BHKs, and both 4 BHK towers have a servant room with its own toilet. Every 3 BHK gets two car parks and every 4 BHK three, all tandem or independent (no mechanised or stack parking), with EV-enabled bays and about 40% of the parking space kept for visitors. Amenities are spread over a landscaped E-deck and a sky level linking all four towers: a swimming pool, leisure and kids'' pools, a temperature-controlled sky pool, sky gym, squash and indoor badminton courts, a paddle and half-basketball court, spa, mini theatre, library and sky workspace. Trump World Centre is about 4 minutes away, Magarpatta Cyber City 11 minutes, Kalyani Nagar 14 minutes and EON IT Park 18 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002400007, registered 20 September 2024) with a proposed completion date of 30 November 2029, and is IGBC pre-certified Gold (August 2024).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002400007"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.49 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "30 November 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002400007", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100030007', 25871, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kar-64xaj6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/283be8d7-6cdf-4f53-bbba-1663780189d7/gallery/mvtc7kdj-bngdx2.webp", "https://punehome.in/stora