inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Godrej Skyline?", "answer": "Godrej Skyline offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Godrej Skyline MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Godrej Skyline is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002400007. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Godrej Skyline?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Library, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-raheja-vistas', 'Raheja Vistas', 'raheja-vistas', 'b-k-raheja-corp', 'Mahalunge', '₹93.00 L - ₹2.80 Cr', '₹93.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tc7-243ai.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tc7-243ai.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-altitude-wakad-pune/Altitude_Master_Plan_2a71829c4d.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/17612270221382269185.png", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1728465989381290610.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1676437348380981470.jpg"]', 'Raheja Vistas is a 7.5-acre residential project by K Raheja Corp Homes near Mahalunge Circle in Mahalunge, West Pune, about 1.5 km from Hinjewadi. It is part of K Raheja Corp''s integrated township across Mahalunge, Maan and Hinjewadi, which gives residents access to a 7.5-acre landscaped central park, a riverside promenade and a high-street retail zone in the making, with Global Indian International School inside the township. Seven towers of G+2+24 floors hold 7 or 8 homes per floor, each tower with 4 lifts, in a neoclassical design by principal architects RSP Design Consultants (India), and about 75% of the land is left open. The 2 BHK homes measure about 680, 765 and 911 sq ft and start at ₹93 lakh, ₹1.10 crore and ₹1.30 crore; the 3 BHK homes measure about 1,111 and 1,298 sq ft, from ₹1.60 crore and ₹1.95 crore, with a 1,472 sq ft 3 BHK duplex from ₹2.25 crore; and the 4 BHK homes measure about 1,360, 1,530 and 1,824 sq ft, from ₹1.90 crore, ₹2.20 crore and ₹2.80 crore. Areas are RERA carpet plus balcony, and prices are all-inclusive starting prices for the first floor; maintenance, floor rise and preferential location charges are extra. More than 40 amenities are spread over 2.6 acres on the podium and ground level, with two clubhouses: a half-Olympic pool with a kids'' pool and jacuzzi, a gym, an indoor sports arena, two squash courts, a badminton court, pickleball and futsal courts, cricket nets, a skating rink, golf putting, cycling and jogging tracks, a spa, an indoor yoga space and yoga deck, a stargazing deck, an amphitheatre, an outdoor cinema, outdoor working pods, a banquet hall, guest rooms, a rooftop party lounge, a crèche and a pet park. Homes are Vaastu compliant, with decks, video door phones and kitchen smoke detectors, and the towers have air-conditioned lobbies, CCTV, controlled access, fire protection and DG backup in the common areas. Solar panels, rainwater harvesting and full wastewater treatment are planned, and the project has applied for IGBC Gold pre-certification. Delhi Public School is 350 m away and Global Indian International School 700 m, Baner about 4 km, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway 3.8 km and Wakad 6.6 km. Towers 1 and 2 are registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002501597 by the promoter KRC Queens Private Limited, with possession committed by the developer for December 2029; the registration''s completion date is 31 July 2031.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501597"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹93 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mahalunge, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501597", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mahalunge Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100061597', 13676, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tc7-243ai.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tfb-6idoxl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15ti6-bw0rea.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tkg-6hkq4c.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tmi-5k9d2i.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tom-aheyxz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tqg-2zrd5x.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tsq-b2h8ww.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f6a3ff23-1594-4885-803c-779ac7881160/gallery/mvu15tvp-e5pmtb.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.5755, 73.7504, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "725 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹93.00 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1022 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.30 Cr - ₹1.67 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1577 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹2.80 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"question": "Where is Raheja Vistas located?", "answer": "Raheja Vistas is strategically located in prime Mahalunge, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Raheja Vistas?", "answer": "Residences in Raheja Vistas start from ₹93 L - ₹2.80 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Raheja Vistas?", "answer": "Raheja Vistas offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Raheja Vistas MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Raheja Vistas is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002501597. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Raheja Vistas?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-privia-naimish', 'Privia Naimish', 'privia-naimish', 'b-privia-group', 'Chikhali', '₹85.00 L - ₹1.50 Cr', '₹85.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/52142406-0fa2-45cb-9d60-c8bb6404417c/gallery/mumd4yga-7wpi5s.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/52142406-0fa2-45cb-9d60-c8bb6404417c/gallery/mumd4yga-7wpi5s.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/yJYYgN6FjHg8otXKZFYokqMcDsDOaiin6tPyDHNW.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1728481601391614931.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/17745426631079376366.jpg"]', 'Privia Naimish on Spine Road, Pimpri-Chinchwad is a premium residential project offering spacious 2 & 3 BHK homes with Jodi options, designed for modern urban living. Strategically located near key hubs, it features an integrated commercial zone and two-level lifestyle amenities including a sky lounge, open gym, and children’s play area. With superior construction quality, smart layouts, and excellent connectivity, Privia Naimish delivers a perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and community.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078327"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configura