lable in Privia Naimish?", "answer": "Privia Naimish offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Privia Naimish MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Privia Naimish is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100078327. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Privia Naimish?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-supreme-towers', 'Supreme Towers', 'supreme-towers', 'b-supreme-universal', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.30 Cr - ₹11.50 Cr', '₹3.30 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK", "5 BHK", "6 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'December 2028', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a5z-4zeh0n.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a5z-4zeh0n.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-hilife-wakad-pune/Hilife_Master_Plan_5c82917d3b.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/qXM8HRWxsHzEqzzkejOkuF5OA14I5dxYYMPiCfKC.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/aePrJFSWXCrLzUuIElRa833tORaxTtYAjSNM78Sh.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/16880357391530657074.jpg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp"]', 'Supreme Towers is a luxury residential project by Supreme Universal, with Sukhwani Realty, in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, Pune, near The Westin. Two towers stand on a 3-acre land parcel, each with a basement, ground and podium level and 32 residential floors, and a Cloud Walk sky bridge on level 33 links them. A typical floor has just four homes, two 3 BHK and two 4 BHK. The 3 BHK homes measure 1,427 sq ft (1,292 sq ft carpet plus 134 sq ft of balconies) and the 4 BHK homes 2,178 sq ft (1,937 sq ft carpet plus 241 sq ft), with a 25 ft living and dining room, a 25 ft 6 in balcony and a servant room with its own toilet. Larger 5 and 6 BHK homes of 2,626 and 2,854 sq ft and 4 BHK duplexes of 4,356 sq ft, which the brochure calls Sky Palaces, are also offered. Prices start at ₹3.30 crore for a 3 BHK, ₹5.16 crore for a 4 BHK, ₹6.50 crore for a 5 BHK, ₹7 crore for a 6 BHK and ₹11.50 crore for a 4 BHK duplex, with floor rise, corpus and maintenance charged extra. Amenities spread over four levels and about 1 lakh sq ft: a rooftop lap pool, Vista sky bar, stargazing deck and outdoor cinema; a jacuzzi, spa, gymnasium, yoga deck and residents'' lounge on the Cloud Walk; a kids'' pool, aqua gym, play area, crèche, amphitheatre and jogging path on the podium; and gardens, a practice court and a multipurpose hall at ground level. Homes have imported marble in the living and dining room, Hansgrohe and Duravit fittings, air conditioning in the living room and every bedroom, a modular kitchen with hob and chimney and DG backup of up to 5 kVA, and the building offers valet parking and a concierge desk. Tower 1 is sold out and Tower 2 is on sale. The towers are registered with MahaRERA as P52100053868 (Tower 1) and P52100056095 (Tower 2), with a RERA completion date of June 2029; the developer expects possession in December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100056095"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2028"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100056095", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100056095', 23125, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a5z-4zeh0n.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2a8a-3d5z11.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2aat-3e6ecc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2ad0-8d8ffk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2aew-fpuxbc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2ait-140uz8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2alb-936sl7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2anh-dmc7to.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2apl-583a2t.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2asb-4tow3g.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2aui-gg1xmc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2awn-fyj9pm.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2ayh-caof8j.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2b0j-98r3ht.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2b2o-g4bwhw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2b4t-adietu.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2b6y-2ip98h.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2b98-w35bs.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2bbd-bm1btw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/4f10ec29-db39-45c9-839e-d1cfeaf743dc/gallery/mvtn2bd4-elv6e5.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5398, 73.9151, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1079 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.30 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1616 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹7.26 Cr - ₹9.24 Cr"}, {"type": "5 BHK", "carpetArea": "1655 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹7.26 Cr - ₹9.24 Cr"}, {"type": "6 BHK", "carpetArea": "733 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹11.50 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"question": "Where is Supreme Towers located?", "answer": "Supreme Towers is strategically located in prime Mundhwa, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Supreme Towers?", "answer": "Residences in Supreme Towers start from ₹3.30 Cr - ₹11.50 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Supreme Towers?", "answer": "Supreme Towers offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Supreme Towers MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Supreme Towers is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100056095. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Supreme Towers?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-atlantis', 'Atlantis', 'atlantis', 'b-kesar-group', 'Bhosari', '₹1.26 Cr - ₹2.01 Cr', '₹1.26 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3uf-bwnu6a.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3uf-bwnu6a.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/yDwMknCek35yZxmMXjayGU9f3YNISUbtB2byb3jE.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1728465957321177475.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/17745428672075565255.jpg"]', 'Atlantis is a residential and retail project in Sector 7, Pradhikaran, Indrayani Nagar, Bhosari, developed by Kesar Group with Tulsi Promoters India and Atharva Buildcon. Above shops on the ground, mezzanine and part of the first floor, it offers 3 and 4 BHK homes that the developer calls villaments, with a typical floor of two 4 BHK and six 3 BHK homes. The 3 BHK homes measure about 1,123 sq ft and the 4 BHK homes about 1,460 sq ft, and the first floor has 3 BHK garden flats of about 1,869 and 1,911 sq ft that come with large private terraces. Agreement values start at ₹1.26 crore for a 3 BHK, ₹1.63 crore for a 4 BHK and ₹1.96 crore for a garden flat; with stamp duty, registration and GST, the total packages are about ₹1.41 crore, ₹1.83 crore and ₹2.20 crore. Every 3 BHK gets two covered car parks and every 4 BHK three. The more than 25 amenities include a swimming pool with an infinity edge and a kids'' pool, a multifunctional gym, a barbecue lounge, indoor games and a multipurpose hall, and a rooftop with a stargazing deck, party deck, yoga deck, exercise station, senior citizens'' seating court and children''s play area. Homes have 800 x 1200 mm tiles throughout, a digital smart lock on the main door, Jaquar or Kohler fittings, AC points in the living room and master bedroom and three-track aluminium sliding windows, and the common areas run on solar panels with generator backup for the lifts. The project is close to the Nashik-Pune highway, Bhosari MIDC, the PIECC exhibition centre and Talawade IT Park, and is registered with MahaRERA (P52100078626).', '["Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078626"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.26 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bhosari, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078626", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bhosari Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078626', 11212, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3uf-bwnu6a.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3wm-b000em.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn3yt-elew25.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn411-4yw6pk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn43a-dsb0wb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn45g-17qorb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn47u-22onb8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn49w-80tgd8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn4bw-1718la.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn4ez-bdc1p6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn4h6-ane4dd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn4j6-7skvvo.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7e61c95f-602f-4601-b133-9770abb853e7/gallery/mvtpn4ld-9tjsc5.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6308, 73.8447, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1029 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.26 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1577 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹2.01 Cr"}]', '["Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"question": "Where is Atlantis located?", "answer": "Atlantis is strategically located in prime Bhosari, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Atlantis?", "answer": "Residences in Atlantis start from ₹1.26 Cr - ₹2.01 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Atlantis?", "answer": "Atlantis offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Atlantis MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Atlantis is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100078626. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Atlantis?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
