iciency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Vision Ekaan MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Vision Ekaan is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002601743. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Vision Ekaan?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Power Backup, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
