spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is The Reserve MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, The Reserve is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002400065. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at The Reserve?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
