nfigurations are available in Zenone?", "answer": "Zenone offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 5 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Zenone MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Zenone is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100053350. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Zenone?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-venkatesh-vanaya', 'Venkatesh Vanaya', 'venkatesh-vanaya', 'b-venkatesh-buildcon-on-old-mundhwa-road', 'Kharadi', '₹1.02 Cr - ₹1.43 Cr', '₹1.02 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6dcdd53e-530b-446c-a6c8-123ef894a217/gallery/mvu457zd-a1y6oz.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6dcdd53e-530b-446c-a6c8-123ef894a217/gallery/mvu457zd-a1y6oz.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/kLEnSzR22c9MFpgzW1q1VBKhcmnWujmwF6wocGF3.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image (38).webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/yiPGuOJ5Fhyx0YB3EzGkjiPFft7mIQsii4HFZdjW.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image (21).webp"]', 'Venkatesh Vanaya is a 10-acre residential project by Venkatesh Buildcon on Old Mundhwa Road, near Oxygen Park in Kharadi, with 4, 3 and 2 BHK homes in 21-storey towers above four levels of parking. The 2 BHK homes have about 777 to 849 sq ft of total carpet area and start at ₹1.02 crore, the 3 BHK homes about 1,107 to 1,203 sq ft from ₹1.43 crore, and the 4 BHK homes in wing D about 1,732 to 1,944 sq ft, including 3 BHK plus service-quarter layouts; areas include balconies and dry balconies, and prices are lump-sum agreement values, with stamp duty, GST, registration, floor rise and preferential location charges extra. More than 25 amenities are planned around a tropical landscape: a swimming pool with a kids'' pool, a clubhouse, gym, yoga room, meditation studio, Zumba and aerobics room, co-working lounge, business centre, reading lounge, crèche, indoor games, multipurpose hall, hobby and art zone and acoustic room, with a multipurpose court, box cricket, pickleball court, outdoor gym, amphitheatre, party lawn, multipurpose lawn with a stage, kids'' play area, jogging track, acupressure pathway and senior citizens'' sit-out outside. Homes have 600 x 1200 mm or 800 x 800 mm vitrified flooring, aluminium or UPVC sliding windows with mosquito nets, a digital lock on the main door, Jaquar or Kohler fittings, concealed copper wiring with AC points in the living room and all bedrooms, a video door phone and Kone or Otis lifts, and the towers are built with aluminium formwork. E-Space IT Park is 1.7 km away, Zensar 2.2 km, EON IT Park and Panchshil Tech Park 3.5 km and the World Trade Centre 3.6 km, with Phoenix Avenue of Stars 2.8 km, Ramwadi metro station 3.3 km and Pune airport 6.1 km. Four phases are registered with MahaRERA: PR1261012601304 (wings K and L), PR1261012601206 (wings I and J), PR1261012601229 (wing H) and PR1261012601264 (wing D); the promoter is SVBPL Homes Pvt. Ltd.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012601304"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.02 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012601304", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100061304', 13092, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6dcdd53e-530b-446c-a6c8-123ef894a217/gallery/mvu457zd-a1y6oz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/pub