755.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5535, 73.9335, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "728 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.02 Cr - ₹1.28 Cr"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1000 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.43 Cr - ₹1.84 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1633 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.43 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"question": "Where is Venkatesh Vanaya located?", "answer": "Venkatesh Vanaya is strategically located in prime Kharadi, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Venkatesh Vanaya?", "answer": "Residences in Venkatesh Vanaya start from ₹1.02 Cr - ₹1.43 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Venkatesh Vanaya?", "answer": "Venkatesh Vanaya offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Venkatesh Vanaya MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Venkatesh Vanaya is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1261012601304. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Venkatesh Vanaya?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Library, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-petals-tathawade', 'Petals', 'petals-tathawade', 'b-pashankar-developers', 'Tathawade', '₹59.49 L - ₹91.00 L', '₹59.49 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4xe-3dqfkr.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4xe-3dqfkr.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/8KKQNl9pXNBZ6numJWe8UNpGknzVelIS0Qg1KIWp.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nmPzChK44V7G0iiNdq6UHi8c9Yqa7WJWDA6qDGUb.webp", "/images/projects/anp-universe/floor-plan-4bhk.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/PGlvfFmgy2VHokL2QsHGliY2jw1aMvsk3u0b9uB8.webp"]', 'Petals by Pashankar Developers is a residential project at Sr. No. 27/1, near Raghunandan Lawns, Nimbalkar Nagar, Tathawade, about 400 m from Dange Chowk and 100 m from the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road. Six wings, A to F, of basement, ground and seven floors hold 147 homes in five layouts: 1 BHK of 438 and 490 sq ft, 2 BHK of 679 and 806 sq ft and 3 BHK of 963 sq ft. The 1 BHK of 490 sq ft is offered at ₹59.49 lakh with an allotted car park and the 2 BHK of 806 sq ft at ₹91 lakh, both all inclusive. Rooftop terraces have landscaped gardens, open gym equipment and gazebo sit-outs, and the project has a Ganesh mandir, a children''s play area and a senior citizens'' area. Homes get a main door with an automated electronic lock with fingerprint access, 1600 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a black granite kitchen platform with a stainless steel sink, powder-coated aluminium sliding windows with mosquito nets, Jaquar or equivalent fittings with hot and cold mixers, concealed copper wiring with Legrand or equivalent switches and AC provision in the master bedroom. The building has 24-hour CCTV and security, a designer entrance gate with a security cabin, a lift with generator backup, solar water heating, a sewage treatment plant and a multi video door phone system. Ravet is about 5 minutes away, the Mumbai-Pune highway about 6, JSPM College of Engineering about 7, Aditya Birla Memorial Hospital about 10, Phoenix Marketcity Wakad about 11 and Hinjewadi IT Park about 15 to 17 minutes. The developer gives completion as February 2027, and the project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100051579.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100051579"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹59.49 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051579", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051579', 13582, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4xe-3dqfkr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n4zp-492rdq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n51x-ewrp7y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n53u-a2w04h.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n566-98vc4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n58h-12m3kt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5bb-ata1d9.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5dm-4e7smc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5fs-d8v3gt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5i4-b5vpcv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5jz-ahn9g1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5lv-49elwa.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5oj-84f8tv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5qn-beafnu.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b93ed04d-dde2-433f-bb89-694ae6959151/gallery/mvu4n5sr-fizmlq.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6168, 73.7509, '[{"type": "1 BHK", "carpetArea": "453 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹59.49 L"}, {"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "708 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹59 L - ₹74 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1043 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹91.00 L"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Petals located?", "answer": "Petals is strategically located in prime Tathawade, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Petals?", "answer": "Residences in Petals start from ₹59.49 L - ₹91 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Petals?", "answer": "Petals offers spacious 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Petals MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Petals is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100051579. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Petals?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, Covered Parking, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-dream-delmont', 'Dream Delmont', 'dream-delmont', 'b-dream-works-realtors', 'Bavdhan', '₹1.07 Cr - ₹1.53 Cr', '₹1.07 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv33n-92xe2v.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv33n-92xe2v.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-sierra-baner-sus-pune/Sierra_Master_Plan_6b71829c3a.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1734594123750942359.jpeg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/OCn2152ubIWYsNscRoF5YYxsHbSz1zNbLdTEKCEn.webp"]', 'Dream Delmont is a residential project by Dream Works Realtors in Bavdhan Budruk, Pune, near Arihant College and about two minutes from Chandni Chowk. It has five towers of up to 24 floors on about 4 acres, with four homes on each floor. It offers 2 BHK homes of 825 sq ft from ₹1.07 crore and 3 BHK homes of 1,110 sq ft from ₹1.53 crore (all-in prices), where the areas are carpet plus balcony (731 and 1,003 sq ft of carpet). About 40,000 sq ft is given to landscaping and amenities: a swimming pool with an infinity edge, a star-gazing deck, an outdoor movie lounge, an amphitheatre with a stage, a BBQ lounge and al-fresco dining, an orchard and herb garden, a temple, a meditation court, yoga and outdoor exercise stations, a gym, a multipurpose court and a podium kids'' play area. Homes get 800 x 1600 mm vitrified flooring, uPVC windows, Grohe or equivalent bathroom fittings and a video door phone. The Mumbai-Bengaluru highway is about a minute away and Kothrud about seven minutes, according to the developer. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100054736, with a RERA completion date of March 2029.', '["Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054736"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.07 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054736", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054736', 12969, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv33n-92xe2v.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv35w-ehywfg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv37w-1lghgu.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv39r-dl2zwl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3c7-7oniz7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3ex-bqkunr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3h2-7h0olp.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3j3-1t3art.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3kv-16clsy.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3mr-8a4rca.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3ok-f2chac.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3qh-fztnbh.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3sc-bkw8rc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3u9-oezqx.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3w8-c7pzd7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3y1-7refmk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv3zz-fm0xio.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv420-elcxqg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv43r-6zecql.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv45l-3b9dcn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv47f-c0x9gh.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv49j-5808ow.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/efc5ccba-be62-4ab9-b3c3-5dd304d1bbc9/gallery/mvupv4bj-cdpqay.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5208, 73.7744, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "726 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.07 Cr - ₹1.34 Cr"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "995 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.50 Cr - ₹1.93 Cr"}]', '["Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"question": "Where is Dream Delmont located?", "answer": "Dream Delmont is strategically located in prime Bavdhan, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Dream Delmont?", "answer": "Residences in Dream Delmont start from ₹1.07 Cr - ₹1.53 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Dream Delmont?", "answer": "Dream Delmont offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Dream Delmont MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Dream Delmont is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100054736. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Dream Delmont?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-sai-kripa-commercial', 'Sai Kripa Commercial', 'sai-kripa-commercial', 'b-sai-nisarg-landmark', 'Ravet', '₹1.33 Cr', '₹1.33 Cr', '["Commercial"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6vl-a7nd8u.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6vl-a7nd8u.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/OrO96DlQ1BdtwMK7CAwta4xb2E56lGlQ1N3qwfrF.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image (38).webp"]', 'Sai Kripa Commercial is the retail floor of Sai Kripa, Krishna Rama Developer''s building on Plot No. 415, Sector 29, Ganesh Nagar, Ravet, in the Pradhikaran area of Pimpri-Chinchwad. Eight shops, numbered 01 to 08, line the ground floor behind glass shopfronts facing a 10.5 m road, with 5 m driveways down both sides of the building. Each shop is a 40 ft deep, 10 ft wide unit, and the developer''s cost sheet gives its size as 555 sq ft. The developer pitches the shops at cafés, boutiques, pharmacies and everyday essentials. Footfall comes from students at PCCOE and the D. Y. Patil schools and colleges, families in Pradhikaran''s residential sectors (the developer cites more than 6,000 homes nearby), commuters using Akurdi railway station and the 36 households in the 3 BHK homes upstairs, which are sold separately as Sai Kripa. PCCOE, D. Y. Patil Dnyanshanti School, DMart Ravet, Global Hospital and Akurdi railway station are about 5 minutes away, the old Mumbai-Pune highway and NH-48 about 10 and Chinchwad station about 12. The building has high-speed lifts, an EV charging point and solar power generation. A shop is ₹1.33 crore agreement value, or ₹1.49 crore including 5% GST, 7% stamp duty and registration. Possession is planned for December 2030 (RERA completion date April 2031). MahaRERA PM1260002500965.', '["EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002500965"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.33 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Commercial"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500965", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100060965', 24000, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6vl-a7nd8u.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy6xx-yxdsi.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy704-6g8wi7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/31cd26d0-3555-4bdf-8c1e-7a840afda71b/gallery/mvuiy73t-eh1g5j.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/17506f3d-4570-4491-940a-8e53076f3147/gallery/mrxe7usm-2dn5pa.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/34e1a7a3-da32-4ff4-b128-2a4e7a4e4dba/gallery/ms389nk0-3rrvzk.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.648, 73.7413, '[{"type": "Commercial", "carpetArea": "579 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.33 Cr"}]', '["EV Charging"]', '[{"question": "Where is Sai Kripa Commercial located?", "answer": "Sai Kripa Commercial is strategically located in prime Ravet, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Sai Kripa Commercial?", "answer": "Residences in Sai Kripa Commercial start from ₹1.33 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Sai Kripa Commercial?", "answer": "Sai Kripa Commercial offers spacious Commercial apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Sai Kripa Commercial MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Sai Kripa Commercial is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002500965. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Sai Kripa Commercial?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including EV Charging, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-aspire-puravankara', 'Purva Aspire', 'aspire-puravankara', 'b-puravankara', 'Bavdhan', '₹1.18 Cr - ₹1.32 Cr', '₹1.18 Cr', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mtsjumbe-34870y.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mtsjumbe-34870y.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/yJYYgN6FjHg8otXKZFYokqMcDsDOaiin6tPyDHNW.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774542811945928505.jpg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ZB60bzT16gilDe2dmK9WOO14yoeSLG7CJOFpK5KQ.webp"]', 'Purva Aspire is a residential project by Puravankara at the foothills of the NDA hills in Bavdhan, Pune, on a 2.5-acre land parcel with two towers of basement, ground, podium and 17 storeys. Its 2 and 3 BHK homes are built around the developer''s Twin Living idea: an indoor living room plus an outdoor lounge, with covered and open balconies, cross ventilation and plenty of daylight. The 2 BHK Grand has about 828 sq ft of usable area (about 719 sq ft RERA carpet) and is priced from ₹1.18 crore, a 928 sq ft 2 BHK is priced from ₹1.32 crore, and the 3 BHK Grand and Luxe have about 1,153 and 1,453 sq ft of usable area (about 984 sq ft RERA carpet). Drinking water is purified in a central treatment plant and supplied straight to the kitchen tap, the clubhouse includes an Oxygen Club supplied with oxygen-optimised fresh air, and homes can be fitted with the BluNex Life intelligent-home package for app and voice control of lighting, cooling and security. Amenities include a swimming pool, yoga pavilion, landscaped central courtyard, gym, indoor games, library and multipurpose hall, with covered car parking, rainwater harvesting and a sewage treatment plant that recycles water for flushing and gardening. The Mumbai-Pune-Bangalore highway (NH 48) is about 5 minutes away, and Hinjewadi IT Park, Baner and Balewadi are close by. The project is registered with MahaRERA (P52100017650).', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100017650"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.18 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100017650", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100017650', 14251, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mtsjumbe-34870y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mvto3ue3-alqj5g.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mvto3ug7-fns08o.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mvto3uid-6134yr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b635d410-6c97-449e-9f8d-75ef5b27ddfe/gallery/mvto3ukb-47s3j.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5175, 73.7705, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "688 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.18 Cr - ₹1.48 Cr"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1072 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.32 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"question": "Where is Purva Aspire located?", "answer": "Purva Aspire is strategically located in prime Bavdhan, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Purva Aspire?", "answer": "Residences in Purva Aspire start from ₹1.18 Cr - ₹1.32 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Purva Aspire?", "answer": "Purva Aspire offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Purva Aspire MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Purva Aspire is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100017650. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Purva Aspire?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Library, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-boston', 'Pride World City Boston', 'pride-world-city-boston', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charholi', '₹72.99 L - ₹77.99 L', '₹72.99 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stv8-aigzir.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stv8-aigzir.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/56RUcH2FcTi4nhHkw0gG3jrlWip1SBX7GquQbPQ9.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1728465957321177475.jpg"]', 'Pride World City Boston is a cluster of compact 2 BHK homes in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune. Planned on about 8.5 acres as ten towers of 23 floors with around 1,800 homes, it is registered with MahaRERA so far in two phases: P52100049648 for towers A, B and C and P52100078307 for towers D, E and F. It offers two 2 BHK sizes, 673 sq ft from ₹72.99 lakh and 726 sq ft from ₹77.99 lakh (carpet area, developer''s 2026 prices). Every 2 BHK has two balconies, an L-shaped living and dining room and an open dry balcony. The towers stand on two landscaped podiums with panoramic views, there are two clubhouses including The Boston Club, and the 50-plus amenities include a football court on the podium, children''s play areas, jogging tracks, a gym and indoor games; parking is fully covered, in a multilevel car park.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100049648"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹72.99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100049648", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100049648', 10845, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stv8-aigzir.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3stxm-esjrem.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/0345fcc0-f941-42e3-b0ca-79fe7ceba616/gallery/mvv3su0h-fei3id.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3266ed23-72ff-41aa-9c4b-6bcd594ab0c8/gallery/mvhthx7e-fx36dr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3266ed23-72ff-41aa-9c4b-6bcd594ab0c8/gallery/mvhthw99-9b0l00.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3266ed23-72ff-41aa-9c4b-6bcd594ab0c8/gallery/mvhthv4k-3x7nnx.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6448, 73.8986, '[{"type": "2 BHK Premium", "carpetArea": "704 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹72.99 L"}, {"type": "2 BHK Grande", "carpetArea": "752 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹77.99 L"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Pride World City Boston located?", "answer": "Pride World City Boston is strategically located in prime Charoli, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Pride World City Boston?", "answer": "Residences in Pride World City Boston start from ₹72.99 L - ₹77.99 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Pride World City Boston?", "answer": "Pride World City Boston offers spacious 2 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Pride World City Boston MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Pride World City Boston is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100049648. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Pride World City Boston?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Jogging Track, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-celestia-heights', 'Celestia Heights', 'celestia-heights', 'b-prapti-buildcon', 'Punawale', '₹67.98 L - ₹95.00 L', '₹67.98 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lfz8-ec7cds.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lfz8-ec7cds.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/hgiRTenojaVcHglxBXqRVHfjihUs6wuNa8Yl46OW.png', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image (83).webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16880362411428051215.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/17745432931171436448.jpg"]', 'Celestia Heights is a residential project by Prapti Buildcon on Kate Wasti Road in Punawale, beside the Kate Wasti forest, with two towers of two basements, ground and 14 storeys. It offers 2 BHK homes of about 747 to 782 sq ft from ₹68 lakh and 3 BHK homes of about 1,044 to 1,049 sq ft from ₹95 lakh (agreement value; about ₹76 to ₹80 lakh and ₹1.07 crore with stamp duty, GST and registration), with an aangan at the entrance of each 3 BHK, two 4th-floor 3 BHK garden homes with private gardens of about 404 and 422 sq ft, and two 527 sq ft 1 BHK homes on the refuge floors. Commercial offices of about 400 to 700 sq ft on the 1st and 2nd floors start at ₹90 lakh. Areas are RERA carpet plus balcony. Amenities include a clubhouse with a gym, hobby room and business centre, a billiards lounge and indoor games, a lawn sitting area, gazebo seating and a barbecue area, and on the top terrace a kids'' play area, sand pit, acupressure pathway, viewing deck, stargazing zone and walking and jogging track. The site is about a kilometre from Laxmi Chowk and about two from Wipro Circle and Hinjewadi Phase 1, close to the 65 m ring road, Life Republic and the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway at the Punawale underpass. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002602252, with possession expected in 2030.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002602252"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹67.98 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002602252", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100022252', 16994, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lfz8-ec7cds.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lg1c-54hp34.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lg3c-dd89f1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lg51-1l8fgk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lg73-afji4y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lg9d-8oqsko.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lgbh-fx9vid.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1c2a076f-5560-471a-b74d-4b10d2c36256/gallery/mvu4lgdj-8mo1f0.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6265, 73.7396, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "751 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹68 L - ₹85 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "989 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹95 L - ₹1.22 Cr"}, {"type": "Office", "carpetArea": "656 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹95.00 L"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Celestia Heights located?", "answer": "Celestia Heights is strategically located in prime Punawale, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Celestia Heights?", "answer": "Residences in Celestia Heights start from ₹67.98 L - ₹95.00 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Celestia Heights?", "answer": "Celestia Heights offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, Office apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Celestia Heights MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Celestia Heights is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002602252. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Celestia Heights?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Co-working Lounge, Jogging Track, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
