t area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Skyway Elite MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Skyway Elite is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002601911. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Skyway Elite?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-vtp-codename-never-before-east', 'VTP Codename Never Before East', 'vtp-codename-never-before-east', 'b-vtp-group', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹3.60 Cr - ₹4.82 Cr', '₹3.60 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2nod-wvqip.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2nod-wvqip.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/y23eQolQreeZxbOCvNAmA6XXJRnsVLTyeeJxCyN9.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/ct7duPh6zz77Wvsn62itR449WOXD0T4CtO4CTCtL.png", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/pkJxGd1gHFGu7mmQK9QruOkJwCN6UjcR7yv24TqQ.webp"]', 'VTP Codename Never Before East is an upcoming VTP Luxe project of duplex ''villas in the sky'' in VTP''s Township Codename Pegasus, New Kharadi, East Pune, near the township''s West Gate and the Mula-Mutha riverside road. The tentative master plan shows two 34-storey towers (T1 and T2) with 17 lower and 17 upper villa levels. Homes come in four duplex types: Privé Villa and Privé Villa Max (3 BHK, about 1,835 and 2,044 sq ft carpet) and Aristo Villa and Aristo Villa Max (4 BHK with a servant room, about 2,453 and 2,531 sq ft). Every villa has a private lift, a double-height living room of about 21 ft, a puja area, marble flooring in the living and dining, a whirlpool bath in the master washroom and smart home controls. Each tower has a grand drop-off and a double-height entrance lobby, and every floor a double-height lift lobby. Amenities include a private clubhouse, swimming pool, steam and sauna, gym, putt-putt golf, box cricket, kids'' play area, a multipurpose court, open-air badminton and pickleball courts, an open-air event lawn and generous parking for large cars. Residents also get township facilities such as high-street shopping, a school, sports academies and landscaped zones. Indicative prices start at about ₹3.60 Cr. The project is in pre-launch: it is not yet registered with MahaRERA and no possession date has been announced.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.60 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051280', 19618, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2nod-wvqip.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2o7m-7tke3o.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2org-csgau2.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2pb9-1ks2f8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2pul-15xr1j.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2qe5-2tjdx5.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2r5n-1m7u08.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3080c1b4-ff23-4ee0-8a58-455bad35d65d/gallery/mvhz2rpx-1b1ccq.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.5209, 73.9742, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1073 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.60 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1786 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹4.82 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is VTP Codename Never Before East located?", "answer": "VTP Codename Never Before East is strategically located in prime Manjari Khurd, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in VTP Codename Never Before East?", "answer": "Residences in VTP Codename Never Before East start from ₹3.60 Cr - ₹4.82 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in VTP Codename Never Before East?", "answer": "VTP Codename Never Before East offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is VTP Codename Never Before East MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, VTP Codename Never Before East is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number MahaRERA Registered. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at VTP Codename Never Before East?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Swimming Pool, 24x7 Security, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-18-aangan', '18 Aangan', '18-aangan', 'b-four-pillars', 'Maan', '₹1.89 Cr', '₹1.89 Cr', '["3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee0x-d824tw.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee0x-d824tw.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-euphoria-kharadi-pune/Euphoria_Master_Plan_9c82613d4b.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/GcpcnUI99erftS3CNypd2i5txdra0VlJzf8WCtWN.webp"]', '18 Aangan is a gated enclave of just 18 independent 3 BHK row houses by Four Pillars in Maan, off Maan Road near Hinjewadi Phase 1 and the Rajiv Gandhi Infotech Park, with Rising Spaces as strategic partner. Each row house has its own entrance, a private car porch, front and rear gardens (side gardens on the end units) and three levels: the living and dining room, kitchen, utility and a bedroom on the ground floor, two bedrooms and a balcony on the first floor, and open terraces on the terrace floor, under a glass-topped staircase that brings daylight into the home. Homes have about 1,110 to 1,263 sq ft of RERA carpet area including balconies (about 1,190 sq ft for the typical units 2 to 11), and about 2,070 to 2,470 sq ft of net sale area including the share of gardens, terrace and parking; prices start at ₹1.89 crore. The houses are Vastu-conscious, with no one living above or below, and each has its own solar panels and EV charging point. The enclave is laid out along 30-foot internal concrete roads behind a designer entrance gate, a 7-foot perimeter wall and 24/7 security, with a leisure swimming pool, an open pagoda, a lawn, a children''s play area, a senior citizens'' sit-out, indoor games, a temple, walkways, DG backup, in-ground road lighting and roadside planting. From Maan Road, Infosys Circle in Phase 1 and the IT companies of Hinjewadi Phases 1, 2 and 3 are a short drive away, and the Mahalunge-Hinjawadi IT Park bridge leads across the Mula river to Mahalunge, Balewadi and Baner. The project is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002501338 by the promoter Four Pillars.', '["Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501338"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.89 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Maan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501338", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Maan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100061338', 17027, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee0x-d824tw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee2v-cnhzvk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee4x-drwo9m.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee6r-e5ofch.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6bc773eb-7656-403b-99d7-978a3cfe26e6/gallery/mvu2ee8p-92s5g0.webp", "https://pune