ce for flats in 18 Aangan?", "answer": "Residences in 18 Aangan start from ₹1.89 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in 18 Aangan?", "answer": "18 Aangan offers spacious 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is 18 Aangan MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, 18 Aangan is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002501338. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at 18 Aangan?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Swimming Pool, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, Covered Parking, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-aarambh', 'Aarambh', 'aarambh', 'b-adi-realtors', 'Balewadi', '₹99.00 L', '₹99.00 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/uWtUJyzOstqZeclQtHvZOYivrkFxSlpcBtUzkk5j.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/uWtUJyzOstqZeclQtHvZOYivrkFxSlpcBtUzkk5j.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/5oObZb7synV62rPVYqZAbCYsgqNubnGbhVrvmYj8.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/cu7T1exp3WjBAuIjjcAQclhBnDwVt0x1lCTQkwlS.webp"]', 'Adi Aarambh by Adi Realtors is a small boutique project in Balewadi, Pune: one tower with 12 residential units on about 0.14 acres, and around 7 storeys. The 2 BHKs are roughly 800 sq ft. The project is RERA registered (P52100079803), with possession scheduled for August 2026. That date has already passed, so check the current RERA status and the actual handover timeline before committing. Amenities look basic (water supply, power backup, covered parking), so the appeal is mainly the Balewadi location rather than lifestyle facilities', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100079803"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹99 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Balewadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100079803", "0% Brokerage & Direct Buil