enities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Power Backup, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-skyone-walhekarwadi', 'Skyone', 'skyone-walhekarwadi', 'b-nawani-developers', 'Walhekarwadi', '₹85.00 L - ₹1.00 Cr', '₹85.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', 'December 2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ckd-f5ryas.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ckd-f5ryas.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/QUSiXbX1yIv3u1F0efgnLHyJgKsJfu0DIDG1r7Wi.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1688035739153130203.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1676437373178770571.jpg"]', 'Skyone is a boutique residential project by Nawani Developers on Ravet Road in Walhekarwadi, Chinchwad, near Rajyog Petrol Pump, on a plot of about a quarter of an acre. Its two buildings now launching, B and C, have just 36 homes on six floors above basement and ground-floor parking, and every flat gets a covered car park. B building has four 2 BHK homes on each floor, of 800 and 817 sq ft, at ₹85 lakh and ₹87 lakh all-inclusive; C building has two 3 BHK homes on each floor, of 957 sq ft, at ₹1 crore all-inclusive. Areas are the MahaRERA carpet area plus the open and dry balconies. Each 2 BHK has a living room of about 15''6" x 10''6" opening onto a 15''6" x 6''7" balcony, a kitchen with a utility area and a 13''6" master bedroom, and the compact 3 BHK has a 16''1" x 15''9" living and dining room and a 16'' x 5'' balcony. Amenities include a jogging track, a children''s play area, a meditation area, a landscaped garden and tree plantation, a designer entrance lobby, solar water, rainwater harvesting, a grey water treatment plant, a video door phone and power backup for the lift, pumps and common areas. Homes have an earthquake-resistant RCC frame with AAC block walls, 800 x 800 mm vitrified tiles, a granite kitchen platform, Jaguar or equivalent fittings and Polycab or RR cables. The developer places Chinchwad railway station, the Aundh-Ravet BRTS road, the Mumbai-Pune Expressway, schools, colleges, hospitals and D-Mart within 5 to 10 minutes. Skyone is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601495, with possession in December 2027.', '["Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601495"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "December 2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Walhekarwadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601495", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Walhekarwadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100021495', 10625, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ckd-f5ryas.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5cma-6gnl0y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5co6-3kozr3.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5cpy-1rzvw1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5crv-ew7xkl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bdc6357f-5214-4ad0-83d5-d0ed962f20b4/gallery/mvuq5ctx-gg5ssu.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.637, 73.7594, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "714 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1000 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.00 Cr"}]', '["Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area", "Yoga Deck"]', '[{"question": "Where is Skyone located?", "answer": "Skyone is strategically located in prime Walhekarwadi, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Skyone?", "answer": "Residences in Skyone start from ₹85 L - ₹1 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Skyone?", "answer": "Skyone offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Skyone MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Skyone is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002601495. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Skyone?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Jogging Track, Power Backup, Landscaped Garden, Covered Parking, Kids'' Play Area, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-valencia', 'Pride World City Valencia', 'pride-world-city-valencia', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charholi', '₹92.49 L - ₹1.23 Cr', '₹92.49 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqqo-a3jvco.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqqo-a3jvco.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/HlZPHQBAei2owiayJmxJZhkdXYVI8emWvLduM451.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nWQwPeaSVaBSmMahbWW0cXS3uJVKN70QzqslX4fM.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/Fb2rGxFdFT1LLFje4Aj4P3GzmiJzikdzBYMoWc5d.webp"]', 'Pride World City Valencia is the newest cluster of Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune, launched in October 2026. The 5.9-acre cluster is planned with five residential towers, a clubhouse with a swimming pool and a retail high street; its first MahaRERA registration, PM1260002602441, covers towers D and E, each with 28 habitable floors and eight homes a floor. It offers 2 BHK homes of 817 sq ft from ₹92.49 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 1,113 sq ft from ₹1.23 crore, all-inclusive with parking and government taxes; the sizes are usable carpet area, RERA carpet of 641 and 962 sq ft plus balconies. Every home faces east or west and comes with home automation, a Yale digital lock, a video door phone, a semi-modular kitchen with hob and chimney, and Jaquar or Grohe fittings. The master plan lists more than 40 amenities, including a swimming pool and kids'' pool, a clubhouse and party lawn, pickleball courts, a MUGA court, a jogging track, a yoga and open gym area, an amphitheatre and a biodiversity park. MahaRERA possession is 31 December 2031.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002602441"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹92.49 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002602441", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100022441', 11320, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqqo-a3jvco.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/05a6436f-a09f-4e07-b08c-56a0a8c5842b/gallery/mvv3sqsu-ei4a27.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/3PxeuRrw4eYgQ0cWzgG2Kgbdw4BwwSRi226tv5os.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/2ocDxHCTXWnA2CnIKGCGcSwin1rTir1eCXkoMNzB.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/tckPqBcVINZBVHdS5Bf2TEn7XG8BA2rNaM34RTIU.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/Zer51XQI5ojyaQkJzALaQDh3PUsVuRYsoTIvuyGp.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6516, 73.8992, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "741 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹92.49 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1041 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.23 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Pride World City Valencia located?", "answer": "Pride World City Valencia is strategically located in prime Charoli, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Pride World City Valencia?", "answer": "Residences in Pride World City Valencia start from ₹92.49 L - ₹1.23 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Pride World City Valencia?", "answer": "Pride World City Valencia offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Pride World City Valencia MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Pride World City Valencia is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002602441. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Pride World City Valencia?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-pride-world-city-miami', 'Pride World City Miami', 'pride-world-city-miami', 'b-pride-purple', 'Charholi', '₹91.00 L - ₹2.74 Cr', '₹91.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sryq-g451jy.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sryq-g451jy.webp', '/images/projects/anp-universe/master-layout.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/in85nexdwWHGTBugbmHouxJBznVFcjkEU4SOl2Qj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/5tGVdoBmlNYzErLGfVKOK1iX1OZIqyzJ17rTGkJ7.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/MePjpM2o9KQjJ6xTMr6aFlHFsoAzGOb15Qt42xOo.webp"]', 'Pride World City Miami is a cluster of 2, 3 and 4.5 BHK homes in Pride Group''s 400-acre Pride World City township at Charholi Budruk in north-east Pune. On about 10 acres, it is planned as nine towers of 23 floors with about 1,200 homes, many facing the hills, and is registered with MahaRERA in two phases: P52100077670 for towers A6, A7 and B1, due in December 2028, and PR1260002502081 for the newer towers A4 and A5, due in April 2030. The A-series towers have 2 BHK homes of 785 to 795 sq ft from ₹91 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 1,059 to 1,161 sq ft from ₹1.20 crore; the B-series towers have larger 3 BHK homes of 1,472 to 1,488 sq ft from ₹1.76 crore and 4.5 BHK homes of 2,260 sq ft from ₹2.74 crore (usable carpet areas, developer''s July 2026 prices). Homes come with smart home automation, wooden flooring in the master bedroom, designer balconies with LED false ceilings, a Yale digital lock, a video door phone, Jaquar or Grohe and Toto or Kohler fittings, and piped gas. More than 40 amenities include a swimming pool with lap, family and kids'' pools and a jacuzzi, a futsal court, box cricket, pickleball, a MUGA court, a gym, a forest trail, a temple and a pet zone.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100077670"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Charoli, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100077670", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Charoli Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100077670', 11592, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sryq-g451jy.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3ss12-29m6p1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3ss3b-1ozh7h.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3ss67-bc7qgs.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3ss9b-g3wdah.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-4e23-86d1-a9759eb8e02c/gallery/mvv3sscd-624uzt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/04909256-14e7-