esigned for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Smruti Garden MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Smruti Garden is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100081081. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Smruti Garden?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-stalwart-business-enclave', 'Stalwart Business Enclave', 'stalwart-business-enclave', 'b-stalwart-developers', 'Baner', '₹2.03 Cr - ₹9.51 Cr', '₹2.03 Cr', '["Office", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqeli-5bffdg.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqeli-5bffdg.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/f9GMlttRsqc66dOt6VQurFR4i48juAfzCiUaFmOs.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/16760094211897237858.jpg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/OCn2152ubIWYsNscRoF5YYxsHbSz1zNbLdTEKCEn.webp"]', 'Stalwart Business Enclave by Kiran Creators & Developers is a 12-storey commercial landmark on the Aundh–Baner Link Road in Baner, near Jupiter Hospital, with premium corporate offices and exclusive showrooms for corporates, IT and consulting firms, doctors, CAs, lawyers, architects and brands. Offices range from about 995 to 3,515 sq ft (and larger combined spaces up to about 7,000 sq ft), and the ground floor has a premium showroom of 1,718 sq ft with a 22-ft double height and mezzanine and strong road frontage. The building has a grand double-height entrance lobby, tall ceilings, breakout zones and three dedicated parking levels (B1, B2 and lower ground) with ample two-wheeler parking and smooth entry and exit. The address links directly to Aundh, Balewadi, Pashan, Hinjawadi and the Mumbai–Bengaluru Highway, minutes from Balewadi High Street and the Baner commercial belt, with an expected rental yield of 8–9%. All-inclusive prices start from ₹2.03 Cr for an office and ₹9.51 Cr for the showroom; the booking amount is 10% of the agreement value. Possession is planned for December 2028. MahaRERA PC1260002600587.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PC1260002600587"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.03 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Office, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PC1260002600587", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100020587', 20391, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqeli-5bffdg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqgoz-7zpbv6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqih0-4a1fht.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/gallery/mtzmqkzf-3mf17d.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/floorplans/mvhwtsuz-3u3eb6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/floorplans/mvhwttlh-f06ion.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/edbd80d8-4bc4-41bc-8999-809af0344a9d/floorplans/mvhwtud0-fexsan.webp", "https://puneho