Business Enclave is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PC1260002600587. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Stalwart Business Enclave?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Rainwater Harvesting, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
