provals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Tej Midtown?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Prime Modibaug Ganeshkhind Road Address, 11-Foot Clear Ceiling Heights, Soundproof Acoustic Double-Glazed Windows, Private Elevator Access, 100% Zero Brokerage Purchase, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-38-daffodils', '38 Daffodils', '38-daffodils', 'b-38-developers', 'Baner', '₹39.75 L', '₹39.75 L', '["Studio"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', 'November 2028', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nBIFK5yY27v8iGeOPunLCcGZJMSxZp8NlvxZwRKD.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/1hrp8Z2H37hCLmuwIlHXP5eaxifc5wiCotUH5cVM.webp"]', '38 Daffodils is a building of pre-leased, fully furnished studio apartments by Bluepearl (Blue Pearl Realty) at Sr. No. 38, Pancard Club Road, Baner, opposite Ambrosia Galaxy and behind Costa Blanca Society. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002500765, with a proposed completion date of November 2028. The building has 84 studios on six floors, 14 to a floor, each of 200 sq ft (16.58 sq m of carpet and 1.96 sq m of service area), with a 12''5" x 14''8" room and a 7''3" x 5''3" toilet. Studios come with beds and mattresses, wardrobes, a smart TV and TV unit, study tables and chairs, an air conditioner, a geyser, lights and fans, and the brochure lists a lounge, an indoor games room, a cafeteria, a gym and a theatre room. Each studio is sold as an investment at ₹39.75 lakh, described as all-inclusive, and leased to the co-living operator Dweller Pro, which the brochure says is legally obliged to pay the rent directly to owners: ₹18,000 a month at the start, rising 15% after three years and 5% a year from the fourth, on a 10-year (5+5) lease with a five-year lock-in. The brochure puts ten years'' rent at ₹26.70 lakh and quotes an average return of 7.40%. By its drive times, SmartWorks and Amar Madhuban Tech Park are 1 to 2 minutes away, Balewadi High Street 5 minutes and Hinjewadi IT Park 10 minutes.', '["Gymnasium"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002500765"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹39.75 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Studio"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "November 2028"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Baner, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002500765", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Baner Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100060765', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zj6-7e49ma.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04zlb-db4o3l.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/060d4b73-861b-4946-a14a-f4cdbd228afb/gallery/mwc04znb-3vptme.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9ec7dd8e-663f-46ec-8417-95f0d3543de8/gallery/mtmr3rt2-d9u004.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9ec7dd8e-663f-46ec-8417-95f0d3543de8/gallery/mtmr3pyj-bj27cw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9ec7dd8e-663f-46ec-8417-95f0d3543de8/gallery/mtmr3of8-bs5eyl.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.557, 73.7883, '[{"type": "Studio", "carpetArea": "650 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹39.75 L"}]', '["Gymnasium"]', '[{"question": "Where is 38 Daffodils located?", "answer": "38 Daffodils is strategically located in prime Baner, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in 38 Daffodils?", "answer": "Residences in 38 Daffodils start from ₹39.75 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in 38 Daffodils?", "answer": "38 Daffodils offers spacious Studio apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is 38 Daffodils MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, 38 Daffodils is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002500765. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at 38 Daffodils?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Gymnasium, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-codename-vybe', 'Codename Vybe', 'codename-vybe', 'b-ranawat-group', 'Anand Nagar', '₹85.00 L', '₹85.00 L', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rswd-7idamn.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rswd-7idamn.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zp0VEmpHjp3nxN9ZDMZAsjt8sftwy04Pt0zchCPr.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774955181630535411.jpeg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1676437595134924226.jpg"]', 'Codename Vybe, also called the Luxury Riverine Collection, is a pre-launch residential project at Anand Nagar on Sinhagad Road, marketed by Ranawat Group with Welworth Realty. It has no MahaRERA registration number yet, and the developer has not published prices, a possession date, the land area or the number of towers; until it is registered, it cannot legally be booked or sold. Plans released so far cover A Building, floors 1 to 11: five 3 BHK layouts of 1,121, 1,198, 1,215, 1,244 and 1,285 sq ft of carpet and a 1,746 sq ft 4 BHK, 53 homes in all. Each typical floor has five homes around one lift lobby with four lifts, one of them a fire lift; the 2nd and 7th are refuge floors, each with one 4 BHK. Every home has a dry balcony off the kitchen and a pooja space, each 3 BHK has three toilets, and up to three bedrooms get walk-in wardrobes. The presentation promises more than 20 amenities and names an infinity-edge pool, a main pool, a clubhouse, a fitness centre, a temple, net cricket, rooftop amenities and a jogging track. Specifications include vitrified flooring, a modular kitchen with a chimney and piped gas, aluminium sliding windows, a digital main-door lock, USB-C points in bedrooms and 2 kV DG backup per flat. Room sizes come from working drawings and may change.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Anand Nagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Anand Nagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051410', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rswd-7idamn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rsyf-9lkjbd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rt0j-3zi7l6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/fe3ecf58-88a1-48db-8f0a-9127bff57588/gallery/mwc0rt2h-ewuzhi.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/gallery/17273291811462413613.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/gallery/base_image/1727329181343519433.jpg"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.4783, 73.8181, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1095 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1810 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool"]', '[{"question": "Where is Codename Vybe located?", "answer": "Codename Vybe is strategically located in prime Anand Nagar, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Codename Vybe?", "answer": "Residences in Codename Vybe start from Price on Request with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Codename Vybe?", "answer": "Codename Vybe offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Codename Vybe MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Codename Vybe is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number MahaRERA Registered. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Codename Vybe?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-mangalam-momento', 'Mangalam Momento', 'mangalam-momento', 'b-mangalam-landmarks', 'Moshi', '₹69.50 L - ₹96.61 L', '₹69.50 L', '["2 BHK", "2.5 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso1b-ag04mv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso1b-ag04mv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/pFuOfY6ZtpCFIT2RdAIOSb2psuUgeLUKT5aP7Txd.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/OdEtAJGuBRZ8wWA1HACcHXBrWsP2uqZofPBtjreG.webp", "/images/projects/anp-autograph/floor-plan-2bhk.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16880362411428051215.jpg"]', 'Mangalam Momento is a two-tower residential project by Mangalam Landmarks on the Pune–Nashik Highway in Moshi, beside Moshi Fire Station and near Bharat Mata Chowk. It is registered with MahaRERA as PR1260002601445, with Preetam Prakash Associates as the promoter, and possession is planned for December 2031. Wings A and B rise to the 29th floor, with ten homes a floor in Wing A and twelve in Wing B, and are built with aluminium formwork. Homes are 2 BHK of 748, 799 and 911 sq ft, 2.5 BHK of 931 sq ft and 3 BHK of 996, 1,016 and 1,041 sq ft, each the carpet area plus dry and open balconies. Prices start at ₹69.50 lakh for the 748 sq ft 2 BHK, about ₹9,300 per sq ft. Amenities are grouped into zones: a pool with a kids'' pool and deck, a pickleball court and a multipurpose half court, a party lawn with a stage and amphitheatre seating, a children''s play area, a senior citizens'' court, a temple and an oxygen park, a yoga and meditation lawn, an exercise yard and a multipurpose hall. Homes get 600 x 1200 mm tiles, wooden-finish flooring in the master bedroom, Jaquar fittings and a video door phone. The brochure puts Bliss Hospital and a Reliance mall 1 km away, Talawade IT Park and Bhosari MIDC 7 km and Pune airport 17 km.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002601445"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹69.50 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Moshi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002601445", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Moshi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100021445', 9291, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso1b-ag04mv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso40-emarzr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso78-2aim9k.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyso9g-7gecya.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbysobw-erjxck.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbysoe1-1cl9tq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbysog7-aeb75b.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbysoic-6xxfms.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbysokn-a13fd7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ee3d3709-ccba-444e-b44c-94c656b58362/gallery/mwbyson5-8ksfvr.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6699, 73.8431, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "742 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹70 L - ₹87 L"}, {"type": "2.5 BHK", "carpetArea": "755 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹70 L - ₹87 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "985 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹96.61 L"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Mangalam Momento located?", "answer": "Mangalam Momento is strategically located in prime Moshi, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Mangalam Momento?", "answer": "Residences in Mangalam Momento start from ₹69.50 L - ₹96.61 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Mangalam Momento?", "answer": "Mangalam Momento offers spacious 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Mangalam Momento MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Mangalam Momento is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002601445. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Mangalam Momento?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-godrej-skyline-commercial', 'Godrej Skyline Commercial', 'godrej-skyline-commercial', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', '₹3.41 Cr - ₹7.57 Cr', '₹3.41 Cr', '["Shop"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrrt-b3tpsu.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrrt-b3tpsu.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nBIFK5yY27v8iGeOPunLCcGZJMSxZp8NlvxZwRKD.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image (40).webp"]', 'Godrej Skyline Commercial is the high-street retail podium of Godrej Skyline, the Godrej Properties project on Ghorpadi–Mundhwa Road in Koregaon Park Annexe, Mundhwa, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002400007. The shops sit at the base of the residential towers, along a 30 m DP road and an 18 m DP road, with more than 150 feet of retail frontage, an entrance lobby with marble flooring and a loading and unloading bay for goods. Ground-floor shops have a mezzanine within an 8.4 m (27.5 ft) floor-to-floor height; the first retail floor is 4.2 m high. The current inventory lists 13 shops: eight on the ground floor, of 750 to 1,203 sq ft of RERA carpet including the mezzanine, at agreement values of ₹4.24 crore to ₹6.80 crore, and five on the first retail floor, of 808 to 1,551 sq ft, at ₹3.41 crore to ₹7.57 crore. That works out to about ₹51,650 to ₹56,560 per sq ft on the ground floor and ₹42,200 to ₹49,400 on the first floor. Shops get vitrified flooring, toughened glass doors, a glass facade with allotted signage space, a centralised AC provision and a high-speed internet provision, with basement parking for cars and scooters and EV provision. Possession is planned for November 2029.', '["Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002400007"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹3.41 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002400007", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100030007', 45477, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrrt-b3tpsu.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrtp-fva3vt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrvf-2nav9e.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrxb-b6bogj.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrrz3-cue7k4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrs11-ad2ghi.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrs2p-4pqed1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/682acbe6-1523-4751-96d3-668325f5cf39/gallery/mwbzrs4r-1wgfo5.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5326, 73.9207, '[{"type": "Shop Premium", "carpetArea": "728 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.41 Cr"}, {"type": "Shop Grande", "carpetArea": "1019 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹7.57 Cr"}]', '["Covered Parking", "EV Charging"]', '[{"question": "Where is Godrej Skyline Commercial located?", "answer": "Godrej Skyline Commercial is strategically located in prime Mundhwa, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Godrej Skyline Commercial?", "answer": "Residences in Godrej Skyline Commercial start from ₹3.41 Cr - ₹7.57 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Godrej Skyline Commercial?", "answer": "Godrej Skyline Commercial offers spacious Shop apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Godrej Skyline Commercial MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Godrej Skyline Commercial is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002400007. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Godrej Skyline Commercial?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Covered Parking, EV Charging, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-luxton-by-saheel-commercial', 'Luxton by Saheel Commercial', 'luxton-by-saheel-commercial', 'b-luxton-developers', 'Wakad', '₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.78 Cr', '₹1.95 Cr', '["Shop", "Office", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gptg-11z3av.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gptg-11z3av.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-euphoria-kharadi-pune/Euphoria_Master_Plan_9c82613d4b.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/NP2lL1RMSOai3XmYdaQdzhOJxWvDzVFYB2q9WRGl.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/NdXJ20cXwaIEvbNcLMqICBTXnHFUDHwqN8v3pGx2.png", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/RWIi7BIWUPzANdMmWgQwl2LXS8AnA1T678vBPvo7.webp"]', 'Luxton by Saheel Commercial is the retail and office block of Luxton by Saheel, a mixed-use project by Saheel Properties at Survey No. 111/1/2, next to Indira School near Shani Mandir Road in Wakad. It is registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002502043, with Neev Sai Developers as the promoter. The ground floor has 15 double-height showrooms, each with a mezzanine: 758, 789 and 909 sq ft of carpet including the mezzanine, priced from ₹4.78 crore. The first floor has 15 shops of 452 to 522 sq ft, from ₹1.95 crore, and a typical office floor holds six offices of 628 to 1,225 sq ft, with prices on request. Most shops have a 12''3" frontage and a 37''6" depth. The brochure describes a transit-oriented development with double-height glass storefronts, seamless access, multi-level commercial architecture and a catchment of more than 1,500 families nearby, on a 100-ft main road close to schools, colleges and the IT parks. It pitches the spaces at cafés, restaurants, clinics, wellness, professional services and lifestyle brands. Possession is planned for June 2030.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002502043"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.95 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002502043", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100062043', 43141, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gptg-11z3av.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gpvu-fliso9.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gpxu-eg21fl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/bc16413d-ccb5-44a6-af16-228c1ca63cf9/gallery/mwc0gq04-ga3k6x.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/79ad62b1-963d-43e6-92e9-7d2a50735dc5/gallery/mvhpt8ry-dr82md.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/79ad62b1-963d-43e6-92e9-7d2a50735dc5/gallery/mvhpt810-35y8c5.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.6028, 73.768, '[{"type": "Shop", "carpetArea": "678 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.78 Cr"}, {"type": "Office", "carpetArea": "556 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.78 Cr"}, {"type": "Showroom", "carpetArea": "724 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹4.78 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Luxton by Saheel Commercial located?", "answer": "Luxton by Saheel Commercial is strategically located in prime Wakad, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Luxton by Saheel Commercial?", "answer": "Residences in Luxton by Saheel Commercial start from ₹1.95 Cr - ₹4.78 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Luxton by Saheel Commercial?", "answer": "Luxton by Saheel Commercial offers spacious Shop, Office, Showroom apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Luxton by Saheel Commercial MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Luxton by Saheel Commercial is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002502043. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Luxton by Saheel Commercial?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Landscaped Garden, Kids'' Play Area, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-arkaa-galaxy', 'Arkaa Galaxy', 'arkaa-galaxy', 'b-agarwal-and-bhondve-buildcon', 'Ravet', '₹68.46 L - ₹1.17 Cr', '₹68.46 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qjyd-3efmmg.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qjyd-3efmmg.webp', '/images/projects/anp-universe/master-layout.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/16880362411012606642.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/16764372401249816501.jpg"]', 'Arkaa Galaxy is a residential project by Agarwal and Bhondve Buildcon LLP in Ravet, behind the PCMC water tank near Chandrabhaga Corner Lane. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100045836, with completion proposed for April 2029. On a 3,000 sq m plot, two towers rise 14 storeys above a ground floor and two parking levels, with separate entry and exit gates, and are joined at the top by a connected rooftop of about 3,500 sq ft holding a lawn, a party and play area, an open theatre, a jogging area, an open fitness area and a lounge. The brochure counts 108 2 BHK homes in Wings A and B. The current cost sheet lists 2 BHK homes of 745, 754 and 781 sq ft at agreement values of ₹68.46 lakh, ₹69.19 lakh and ₹71.69 lakh, and a single 1,273 sq ft 3 BHK (B-702) at ₹1.17 crore. Every flat gets an inverter backup, and the building has DG backup for the lifts and common areas, CCTV, a video door phone, solar water heating, rainwater harvesting and an organic waste converter. Homes have vitrified tiles throughout, a granite kitchen platform, aluminium sliding windows with mosquito mesh, a folding door to the living-room balcony and AC provision in the living room and master bedroom.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100045836"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹68.46 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100045836", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100045836', 9189, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qjyd-3efmmg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qk0c-c625wb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qk27-civs6r.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qk49-fnx9t2.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/d84e8031-0038-46c2-8600-bde888988008/gallery/mwc1qk68-2gzdxm.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6507, 73.7444, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "691 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹68 L - ₹86 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1033 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.17 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Arkaa Galaxy located?", "answer": "Arkaa Galaxy is strategically located in prime Ravet, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Arkaa Galaxy?", "answer": "Residences in Arkaa Galaxy start from ₹68.46 L - ₹1.17 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Arkaa Galaxy?", "answer": "Arkaa Galaxy offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Arkaa Galaxy MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Arkaa Galaxy is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100045836. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Arkaa Galaxy?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Power Backup, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-the-crown-highstreet', 'The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya', 'the-crown-highstreet', 'b-the-skies-group', 'Thergaon', '₹1.17 Cr - ₹3.79 Cr', '₹1.17 Cr', '["Shop", "Showroom"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2713d-3srwqt.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2713d-3srwqt.webp', '/images/projects/anp-universe/master-layout.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/aU0av4R1IIxdmArOOo0urjB7axIHKZzbIOiGbl5G.webp", "/images/projects/anp-atlantis/floor-plan-2bhk.webp"]', 'The Crown Highstreet is the retail podium of Ace Ayodhya, the four-tower residential project by Jhamtani Group and Shree Venkateshwara Group on the 45-metre Aundh–Ravet BRTS road near Dange Chowk, Thergaon. It is registered with the homes under MahaRERA PR1261012600416, with Ace Venkateshwara Realty as the promoter. The high street has 22 shops on the ground floor and 22 on the first, of 355 to 1,147 sq ft of carpet, plus seven showrooms of 1,983 to 5,678 sq ft over both floors, facing a high-street plaza along a 12-metre road. Agreement values on the current cost sheets work out to ₹37,500 per sq ft on the ground floor and ₹33,000 on the first: from ₹1.33 crore for a 355 sq ft ground-floor shop and ₹1.17 crore for the same size upstairs, up to ₹4.30 crore for a 1,147 sq ft ground-floor shop. Showroom prices are on request. The renders show a colonnaded concourse beneath the towers, and the plans show lift lobbies and a commercial ramp to the basement. Possession is planned for December 2030.', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1261012600416"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.17 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Showroom"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Thergaon, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1261012600416", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Thergaon Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100060416', 32969, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2713d-3srwqt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1a5ae56c-c292-41e3-bb5e-b67d61edcac1/gallery/mwc2715n-5incre.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkisp-8jfjpx.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkivc-81wzyd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkiy5-96mu5o.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7961ad75-4a1a-477e-a5ef-29a8b2422b2c/gallery/mwevkj0w-46ufr8.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6151, 73.7786, '[{"type": "Shop", "carpetArea": "737 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.17 Cr - ₹3.79 Cr"}, {"type": "Showroom", "carpetArea": "689 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.79 Cr"}]', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"question": "Where is The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya located?", "answer": "The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya is strategically located in prime Thergaon, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya?", "answer": "Residences in The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya start from ₹1.17 Cr - ₹3.79 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya?", "answer": "The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya offers spacious Shop, Showroom apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1261012600416. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at The Crown Highstreet at Ace Ayodhya?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Covered Parking, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-serenopolis', 'Serenopolis', 'serenopolis', 'b-nirman-greens', 'Tathawade', '₹80.62 L - ₹97.75 L', '₹80.62 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5m1-1nxgpq.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5m1-1nxgpq.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/yJYYgN6FjHg8otXKZFYokqMcDsDOaiin6tPyDHNW.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774955201693618606.jpeg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/16764375681105592794.jpg"]', 'Serenopolis is a single 14-storey tower of 121 homes by Nirman Greens in Nirman District, Tathawade, where it joins the developer''s Astropolis and Cosmopolis. It stands on Link Road in Ashok Nagar, next to Sharayu Toyota, with commercial spaces at its base, and is registered with MahaRERA as P52100080004, with completion proposed for April 2029. It offers 2 BHK homes of 757 and 779 sq ft from ₹80.62 lakh and 3 BHK homes of 921 sq ft from ₹97.75 lakh (base prices; about ₹90.61 lakh and ₹1.09 crore all inclusive). More than 35 amenities are spread over three levels: a jogging track and a reception lobby on the ground; a swimming pool, kids'' pool, gym, indoor games area and yoga deck on the podium; and a party lawn, stage, open-air cinema, kids'' and toddlers'' play areas, a star-gazing deck and senior citizens'' seating on the terrace. Homes get Italian-finish vitrified flooring, full-height bedroom windows, a modular kitchen with a chimney, a gas leak detector and sprinklers, AC in the master bedroom, AC points in every room and a digital main-door lock. By the brochure''s drive times, Pulse Hospital, JSPM College and the Mumbai–Bengaluru highway are 3 minutes away and a metro station and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 10 minutes.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080004"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹80.62 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080004", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080004', 10649, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5m1-1nxgpq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5nv-3hw4g8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5px-8rsysy.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5rp-97cgpz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5th-c2swuy.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5vs-fy9rb1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5xt-6c6mpp.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i5zs-5wiplg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/24ca7459-95bd-4594-85b9-4b2d720268ff/gallery/mwc1i623-7y4mbh.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6236, 73.7535, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "758 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹80.62 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1063 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹97.75 L"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Serenopolis located?", "answer": "Serenopolis is strategically located in prime Tathawade, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Serenopolis?", "answer": "Residences in Serenopolis start from ₹80.62 L - ₹97.75 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Serenopolis?", "answer": "Serenopolis offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Serenopolis MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Serenopolis is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100080004. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Serenopolis?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-city-one-panache-commercial', 'City One Panache Commercial', 'city-one-panache-commercial', 'b-city-one', 'Ravet', '₹80.59 L - ₹22.48 Cr', '₹80.59 L', '["Shop", "Office"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamia-8f90y4.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamia-8f90y4.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/1hrp8Z2H37hCLmuwIlHXP5eaxifc5wiCotUH5cVM.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/zmj4n4TECfiXjZQ6PK1OM0lDjNqeGFoqs5NMDueV.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16880362411428051215.jpg"]', 'City One Panache Commercial is the shop and office podium of City One Panache 2.0, a 26-storey tower in Sector 29 of the Pradhikaran area of Ravet, Pimpri-Chinchwad, registered with MahaRERA as PM1260002600510. The ground floor has 28 shops, numbered 1 to 29 (there is no shop 2), wrapped around a commercial parking court, with road frontage on three sides; the developer''s price list groups them as main-road, EVM and garden facing. Shops 1 to 21 come with a mezzanine and shops 22 to 29 without one. Carpet areas run from 191 to 663 sq ft, and the price list of 27 September 2026 prices them from ₹80.59 lakh (191 sq ft, garden facing) to ₹5.02 crore (663 sq ft, main road). Two offices of 4,460 sq ft each face the main road at ₹22.48 crore apiece. The ground floor plan keeps the residential entrance, lobby and lifts separate from the shops, with ramps to a basement and a parking level. The developer puts EuroKids preschool 2 minutes away, Ojas Multispeciality Hospital in Ravet 3 minutes, the Sant Tukaram Maharaj bridge 4 minutes, PCCOE and Akurdi railway station 5 minutes, Oxycare Superspeciality Hospital 6 minutes, Orchids The International School 10 minutes, and Aditya Birla Hospital and Lokmanya Hospital Chinchwad about 15 minutes away. Possession is planned for December 2028.', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002600510"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹80.59 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "Shop, Office"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002600510", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100020510', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamia-8f90y4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6afd9e53-566c-495c-8534-7ef6714229a9/gallery/mwbwamkd-g6d6xq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e318d63d-9129-4001-a542-221d6dc512df/gallery/mv6kv02o-1lb3zm.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e318d63d-9129-4001-a542-221d6dc512df/gallery/mv6kv28x-5e9vqd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e318d63d-9129-4001-a542-221d6dc512df/gallery/mv6kv4en-47eujl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e318d63d-9129-4001-a542-221d6dc512df/gallery/mv6kv6c3-b8nxlx.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6447, 73.7475, '[{"type": "Shop", "carpetArea": "697 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹80.59 L"}, {"type": "Office", "carpetArea": "623 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹80.59 L - ₹22.48 Cr"}]', '["Covered Parking"]', '[{"question": "Where is City One Panache Commercial located?", "answer": "City One Panache Commercial is strategically located in prime Ravet, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in City One Panache Commercial?", "answer": "Residences in City One Panache Commercial start from ₹80.59 L - ₹22.48 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in City One Panache Commercial?", "answer": "City One Panache Commercial offers spacious Shop, Office apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is City One Panache Commercial MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, City One Panache Commercial is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002600510. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at City One Panache Commercial?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Covered Parking, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-ace-ayodhya', 'Ace Ayodhya', 'ace-ayodhya', 'b-over-40-curated-lifestyle-amenities', 'Thergaon', '₹39.00 L - ₹92.00 L', '₹39.00 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f0b24c37-657e-4713-a35f-c1b0d9e96998/gallery/mrpbpbt9-5sv0q6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/f0b24c37-657e-4713-a35f-c1b0d9e96998/gallery/mrpbpbt9-5sv0q6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/MePjpM2o9KQjJ6xTMr6aFlHFsoAzGOb15Qt42xOo.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/dS3PCn4Zmfevi02ZqMfIVLhUbyT8IDY8hkxIqqzj.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/UPzmG4euaO1BOdmqRNMXOBWt8x0Bj8yXV84daLnk.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774955181630535411.jpeg"]', 'Ace Ayodhya by Jhamtani Group and Shree Venkateshwara Group is a grand 5-acre residential township located in Thergaon, Pune, right off the 45-meter Aundh-Ravet BRTS corridor and minutes from Dange Chowk.
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-kuber-antonia', 'Kuber Antonia', 'kuber-antonia', 'b-kuber-properties', 'Wakad', '₹84.56 L', '₹84.56 L', '["2 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyb7-21nuz.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyb7-21nuz.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-euphoria-kharadi-pune/Euphoria_Master_Plan_9c82613d4b.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/17284659391446479583.jpg"]', 'Kuber Antonia is a residential project by Kuber Properties, with Bhandare Associates as joint-venture partner, behind Hotel Tip Top International and beside Yashwin Encore in Wakad, close to Bhumkar Chowk and the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway. It offers only 2 BHK homes of 730 sq ft (637 sq ft of RERA carpet plus 93 sq ft of balconies), five to a typical floor with two lifts. On the B building cost sheet, a 2 BHK costs ₹84.56 lakh as agreement value, including ₹5.25 lakh of infrastructure charges, or about ₹95 lakh with stamp duty, GST and registration. Each home has a 16''0" x 10''6" living and dining room with a balcony, an 8''0" x 10''4" kitchen with a dry balcony, a 14''0" x 10''6" master bedroom with its own bathroom and balcony, a 10''0" x 10''0" second bedroom and a second bathroom. At ground level there are a clubhouse with the Power Club co-working space, a swimming pool, a jacuzzi, a jogging track, a barbecue zone, a deck, a party lawn and pergolas, and the rooftop deck, more than 100 feet above the ground, adds a yoga and meditation area, an open gym, board games, gazebos, a party lawn, a children''s play area and a senior citizens'' sit-out. Homes come with 800 x 800 mm vitrified flooring, American Standard sanitaryware and Grohe fittings, split AC points in the living room and both bedrooms, a video door phone, solar hot water and 24x7 security with CCTV. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100035197, with possession planned for April 2027.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100035197"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹84.56 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100035197", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100035197', 11583, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyb7-21nuz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kydf-g81hiz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyfj-9heupb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyhi-djaj1y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyjd-f06fsi.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kylc-8l1r9y.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyna-ao946s.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/904e6ae3-ea42-409c-b46e-8c879b2294b7/gallery/mvv4kyp8-ovbi4.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5945, 73.773, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "690 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹84.56 L"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"question": "Where is Kuber Antonia located?", "answer": "Kuber Antonia is strategically located in prime Wakad, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Kuber Antonia?", "answer": "Residences in Kuber Antonia start from ₹84.56 L with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Kuber Antonia?", "answer": "Kuber Antonia offers spacious 2 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Kuber Antonia MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Kuber Antonia is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100035197. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Kuber Antonia?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Co-working Lounge, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
