y within about a kilometre, Vision One Mall about 2 km away and Chinchwad railway station roughly 7 to 8 km away. The project is registered with MahaRERA under P52100080096 with a proposed completion of 31 December 2028.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080096"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.48 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080096", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080096', 20163, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn571w-66kq18.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn58qj-9gr1kq.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5amn-2kngyb.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5ckf-bkgpg1.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5egp-bmfs1i.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5g1l-b8jqh4.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5hl6-6xhg5i.jpg", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/e0bddd57-1189-435c-9a61-82e7913baff8/gallery/mvhn5j8n-e7ve9y.jpg", "https://punehome.in/stora