s spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is New Launch Highness Wakad MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, New Launch Highness Wakad is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002502183. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at New Launch Highness Wakad?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-excellaa-polaris', 'Excellaa Polaris', 'excellaa-polaris', 'b-excellaa-realty', 'Bavdhan', '₹2.59 Cr - ₹3.10 Cr', '₹2.59 Cr', '["4 BHK", "4.5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dct-8va6z1.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dct-8va6z1.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/c5iyPCgaCqPe2H7UgjtMuIlxz0gkapjWv7U5nlzE.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/N8h0pFp4t9iPbyC01tcUgFFE2sNIrbMiZg3aekTp.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/f9GMlttRsqc66dOt6VQurFR4i48juAfzCiUaFmOs.webp"]', 'Excellaa Polaris is a single-tower luxury project near Ambrosia Resort in Bavdhan Khurd, Bavdhan, Pune, close to Chandani Chowk, by Excellaa Realty as part of its Autograph Collection. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100080233 and possession is planned for December 2030. The tower rises 27 residential floors above three podium levels on a 2-acre plot, with six homes on each floor. Homes are marketed as 4.25 and 4.75 BHK: the 4.25 BHK has four bedrooms and a maid''s zone in 1,781 to 1,800 sq ft of carpet including balconies, and the 4.75 BHK adds a staff quarter with its own toilet in 1,887 to 1,946 sq ft. Every home has two master suites with walk-in wardrobes, a living and dining room of up to 24 by 15 feet, a service deck off the kitchen, imported marble flooring and a 3.27 m slab-to-slab height. Prices start at ₹2.59 Cr for the 4.25 BHK and ₹3.10 Cr for the 4.75 BHK. Over 45 amenities across 50,000 sq ft include a rooftop climatised infinity pool at 321 ft, a ballroom, sky lounge, golf terrace, sports pavilion, health studio, business centre and cafe.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100080233"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹2.59 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "4 BHK, 4.5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Bavdhan, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100080233", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Bavdhan Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100080233', 14542, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dct-8va6z1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dfa-8zcbhe.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dhv-g9f5ba.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dk3-fza751.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dmb-1z8ag4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6doh-5yv62f.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dqw-dtf0sw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/6d2e5940-bda2-446e-8ec4-a961da61284a/gallery/mvwk6dt1-f