uilder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Excellaa Polaris?", "answer": "Excellaa Polaris offers spacious 4 BHK, 4.5 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Excellaa Polaris MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Excellaa Polaris is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100080233. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Excellaa Polaris?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
