um carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Hiranandani MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Hiranandani is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number MahaRERA Registered. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Hiranandani?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
