unit configurations are available in Sentosa Harico Diwaam?", "answer": "Sentosa Harico Diwaam offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Sentosa Harico Diwaam MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Sentosa Harico Diwaam is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002502389. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Sentosa Harico Diwaam?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
