3.09 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Austin Aurus?", "answer": "Austin Aurus offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Austin Aurus MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Austin Aurus is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002601438. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Austin Aurus?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
