TV. NH48 is about 900 m away, Mukai Chowk BRT station about 4.1 km, Akurdi railway station about 4.5 km and Vision One Mall in Wakad about 3.5 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under P52100055009, with possession targeted for December 2027.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100055009"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹73.91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Punawale, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100055009", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Punawale Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100055009', 10917, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypv2r-3xk6hd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypwgo-2d6efz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypxio-6ydv51.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgypzie-ztcri.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgyq0b3-2etb2u.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgyq189-7q4pdk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/gallery/mvgyq1zz-gb5vz6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3f5cde23-0711-4d66-bf8a-15b8ed16d1d3/galler