 to 0.8 km away, D-Mart about 1.4 km, Basant Plaza about 1.9 km and the Pune-Mumbai highway about 3.8 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100078935, with proposed completion on 31 December 2030.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100078935"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹86.83 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100078935", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100078935', 11485, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1lsm-5ci80s.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1mss-4atuma.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1ns3-1v7j2b.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1orv-8knoo2.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1prv-1yyh29.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1qwv-8kpu9v.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1sd0-56zof.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7c15740e-3e56-49b7-86ad-3f50e9c2761e/gallery/mvfc1tjk-52p7ny.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage