n 73 PARK?", "answer": "73 PARK offers spacious 1 BHK, 2 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is 73 PARK MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, 73 PARK is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002601181. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at 73 PARK?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
