jewadi IT Park about 10 minutes and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium about 5 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PR1260002501984, with possession due in March 2032.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002501984"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹89.90 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002501984", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100061984', 12769, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c1ebbb5a-44d9-40d9-94ba-39a17afb7802/gallery/mvfc3lk5-cadxtj.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c1ebbb5a-44d9-40d9-94ba-39a17afb7802/gallery/mvfc3mrk-ax6zg5.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c1ebbb5a-44d9-40d9-94ba-39a17afb7802/gallery/mvfc3o2x-f5pje.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/3heONbZszM6nV1D5cGGWNerwu18xb77gy1pOfeUA.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/YTtsmyn6nPe5Hzq7tFVwCPJn8iJkuXEa1g8tpTMs.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/dRkDonPR1eXndCLucTp17YruBhz2634DUGQ5X3YG.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5951, 73.7703, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "693 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹89.90 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1085 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.20 Cr"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"question": "Where is Kohinoor Avantara located?", "answer": "Kohinoor Avantara is strategically located in prime Wakad, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Kohinoor Avantara?", "answer": "Residences in Kohinoor Avantara start from ₹89.90 L - ₹1.20 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Kohinoor Avantara?", "answer": "Kohinoor Avantara offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Kohinoor Avantara MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Kohinoor Avantara is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002501984. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Kohinoor Avantara?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
