School about 700 metres, Decathlon 1.6 km and Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 2.3 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number PM1261012501933; confirm the possession date with the sales team and on the MahaRERA portal before booking.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1261012501933"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.12 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Wakad, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1261012501933", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Wakad Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100031933', 13793, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42mhg-2mrw30.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42n62-5ruouc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42ns1-g1o4t5.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42odr-av1816.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42p3d-1tvezn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42pvm-6umpdt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42qiy-6ddet4.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9caa7b33-d668-4189-b6bf-cf105a9ae1ed/gallery/mvf42rap-2mwtqf.we