 project is registered under MahaRERA number P52100054888 with a proposed completion date of 31 December 2029. Contact the Pune Home team for current availability, the latest price sheet and a site visit.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054888"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹85 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "31 December 2029"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Ravet, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054888", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Ravet Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054888', 11288, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblt6r-667qht.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfbltv8-jnik0.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblurb-dmrwu1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblvx3-cm6eq6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblwn3-clqusp.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblxat-bxd2jn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblxwh-87jxki.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/b80dcfb1-9a8c-4126-8545-75666ce1fed6/gallery/mvfblykf-12oe6x.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.652, 73.74