 Ace Abode is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P521000341771. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Jhamtani Ace Abode?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-akshara-mayfair', 'Akshara Mayfair', 'akshara-mayfair', 'b-garve-developers-is-a-2', 'Tathawade', '₹91.00 L - ₹1.41 Cr', '₹91.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlfdp-amhhyv.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlfdp-amhhyv.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/dVV2cx7KeQONobjzrxtwJm7Z6viFIsjkYb5lBMOc.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/3K1d5aSB23mtWUwKhqAuWcReKd3jpS1SygdeiM9N.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/uqOD7mlgMLBjjrzWsFb4eCL82f0hldUzEuA03gyR.webp"]', 'Akshara Mayfair by Garve Developers is a 2.25-acre residential development in the heart of Tathawade, behind G.G. International School and Hotel Raaga Imperio at Newale Wasti, close to the Aundh–Ravet BRTS Road and the Mumbai–Bengaluru Highway. Two towers, A and B, rise B1 + B2 + ground + 21 storeys with just eight homes per floor and about 350 residences in all – a boutique, mostly-3 BHK community – served by four passenger lifts and a dedicated fire/service lift in each tower. Homes are spacious 2 BHK of 773 sq ft, 3 BHK Classic of 942 sq ft and 3 BHK Premium of 1,200 sq ft carpet area; the 3 BHK Premium has walk-in wardrobes and a separate dining area. More than 40 lifestyle amenities are spread across about an acre in three zones: a Courtyard Retreat with a semi-covered canopy pool, kids'' pool, community lawn, party deck, multiplay court, yoga pavilion and garden pavilions; a Leisure Retreat with a grand entrance lobby, multipurpose hall, indoor gym and business/conference room; and a rooftop Skyline Retreat with an open-air cinema, pickleball court, sky work pods, wellness deck, green gym, barbeque area, hammock and swing garden and a sunrise and star-gazing deck. The building adds smart water metering, solar integration and an IoT backbone. G.G. International School is within walking distance, with daily essentials, Wakad and Hinjewadi a short drive away. All-inclusive prices start from ₹91 Lakh for a 2 BHK, ₹1.12 Cr for a 3 BHK Classic and ₹1.41 Cr for a 3 BHK Premium. Possession is planned for December 2029; MahaRERA registration is awaited.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "Verified Registered"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹91 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: Registered", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100062989', 11772, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlfdp-amhhyv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlg8l-ai9bkh.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlh60-cg7gaw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlhvk-f0youf.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtliky-ag9w4t.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtljae-k174n.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlk1i-3ynwls.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlkse-c4jxrt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtllgr-b78ttt.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhtlm6y-9l1hz.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugdo4-orjrr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugfb8-4xw6e.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugg9n-eoh78a.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugh0i-24btu8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhughvq-5d08z7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugit0-3nksaa.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugjik-5mmbr5.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555733ca/gallery/mvhugkdl-1453g0.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/340e4638-dc06-4c97-aac3-4a01555