?", "answer": "Yes, Tulip Infinity Evana is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100078470. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Tulip Infinity Evana?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
