ntilation."}, {"question": "Is Majestique Evolvus MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Majestique Evolvus is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100054253. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Majestique Evolvus?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Library, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
