ffers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is The Rising Saniket MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, The Rising Saniket is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100050643. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at The Rising Saniket?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
