ut 1 km away, Podar International School 1.5 km, Phoenix Mall of the Millennium 2.6 km, EON IT Park 4.3 km and Hinjawadi IT Park 4.7 km. Possession is proposed by March 2028 as per the MahaRERA certificate.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100066556"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Tathawade, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100066556", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Tathawade Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100066556', 13793, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg1ep-16nl8t.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg1yc-cxre7i.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg2i3-cleatq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg2xa-td4oq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg3d5-279mqa.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg43a-fv8m6z.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg4mx-bhduwb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/11d4b1b2-bce0-4f62-a40e-4137bedda4a7/gallery/mvfbg51o-boq45z.webp", "https://punehome.in/storag