d for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Neco Park Central MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Neco Park Central is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100077542. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Neco Park Central?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Rainwater Harvesting, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
