ation number PM1262022501416. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Tej One Baner?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Rainwater Harvesting, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-vtp-flamante', 'VTP Flamante', 'vtp-flamante', 'b-vtp', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹1.30 Cr - ₹3.10 Cr', '₹1.30 Cr', '["2 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3d5m-ae6hxl.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3d5m-ae6hxl.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/nmPzChK44V7G0iiNdq6UHi8c9Yqa7WJWDA6qDGUb.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/Tj3y8qp05piS5DyKdZNR5CmqntpkgK0jXLq6DkBE.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/pkJxGd1gHFGu7mmQK9QruOkJwCN6UjcR7yv24TqQ.webp"]', 'VTP Flamante (Flamante by VTP Luxe) is a large residential project by VTP Realty in New Kharadi (Manjri), East Pune, part of the integrated Township Codename Pegasus. Spread over about 6 acres with around 2 acres of open space, it has six towers of 33 residential floors above parking and about 1,057 homes, with four or six apartments per floor. Homes on offer include 2 BHK apartments of about 850 sq ft carpet from Rs 1.30 Cr and 4 BHK apartments of about 1,794 sq ft carpet at Rs 3.10 Cr. Residences come with smart-home features, a digital lock, large marble-finish vitrified tiles, large windows and balconies with toughened-glass railings. The amenities hub includes an infinity-edge swimming pool, a clubhouse and multipurpose hall, an indoor gym, squash and lawn tennis courts, net cricket, a multipurpose court, a kids'' pool and play areas, a skating rink, an amphitheatre, jogging and cycling tracks, a meditation lawn and a work-from-home zone with outdoor work spaces under solar canopies. Residents also get township amenities such as sports academies, a township club and a school. EON IT Park is about 3.4 km away, WTC 3.8 km, the Pune-Nagar Highway 3.5 km and the airport about 9.5 km. Possession is planned from March 2028. MahaRERA: P52100051826 (Phase 1) and P52100055365 (Phase 2).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100051826"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.30 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100051826", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100051826', 15294, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3d5m-ae6hxl.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3dum-d7hv8c.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3eys-elub2c.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3fvz-99qth3.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3gp9-dw4e3p.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3hki-762pxp.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3ikx-d620tn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/890f823d-cfcf-45fe-930d-de268253086f/gallery/mvhz3jhc-5so7p8.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.521, 73.9808, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "711 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.30 Cr - ₹1.63 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1669 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.10 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"question": "Where is VTP Flamante located?", "answer": "VTP Flamante is strategically located in prime Manjari Khurd, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in VTP Flamante?", "answer": "Residences in VTP Flamante start from ₹1.30 Cr - ₹3.10 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in VTP Flamante?", "answer": "VTP Flamante offers spacious 2 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is VTP Flamante MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, VTP Flamante is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100051826. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at VTP Flamante?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-hill-crest', 'PK Hillcrest', 'hill-crest', 'b-pk-group', 'Pimple Saudagar', '₹85.00 L', '₹85.00 L', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2w3y-8gi6u6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2w3y-8gi6u6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/HlZPHQBAei2owiayJmxJZhkdXYVI8emWvLduM451.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16842409551461585858.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1774955201963424212.png"]', 'PK Hillcrest is a residential project by PK Group on Jarvari Road, near PK International School, in Pimple Saudagar, Pune 411027. The development rises to G+22 floors with Wing A and Wing B, and offers 3 BHK homes with 975 to 980 sq ft of carpet area and 4 BHK homes with 1,438 sq ft of carpet area, according to the project website. Prices are not published, so the site shows price on request. Amenities include a clubhouse, an infinity pool with a shallow pool, a double-height gym, an indoor games room, a party lawn, a multi-play court, a toddlers'' play zone, guest rooms and a co-working space. PK International School is about 180 m away, Lotus Hospital about 600 m, Kokane Chowk about 900 m and 18 Degree Mall about 1.7 km. Wakad is about 5.5 km from the site. The project is registered with MahaRERA under number P52100045782, with a RERA possession date of November 2027. Contact the Pune Home team to book a site visit or request the current price sheet.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100045782"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Saudagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100045782", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Saudagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100045782', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2w3y-8gi6u6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2wpy-l3jg5.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2xkw-ef18h9.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2y64-8d0kph.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2ym5-3v3jc8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2z84-e8c1w0.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc2zqa-dqg9h3.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc30c3-7vaics.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc30sa-ct7tb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/ffa48e6f-5069-4aed-8dfe-6745fdfa4c6b/gallery/mvfc318z-9ebd0g.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.6028, 73.8026, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1054 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1677 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}]', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security"]', '[{"question": "Where is PK Hillcrest located?", "answer": "PK Hillcrest is strategically located in prime Pimple Saudagar, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in PK Hillcrest?", "answer": "Residences in PK Hillcrest start from Price on Request with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in PK Hillcrest?", "answer": "PK Hillcrest offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is PK Hillcrest MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, PK Hillcrest is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100045782. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at PK Hillcrest?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including CCTV Surveillance, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-park-eden', 'Park Eden', 'park-eden', 'b-park-developers', 'Kharadi', '₹1.99 Cr - ₹3.33 Cr', '₹1.99 Cr', '["3 BHK", "4 BHK"]', 'Ready to Move', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb4h9-a0m0kn.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb4h9-a0m0kn.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-sierra-baner-sus-pune/Sierra_Master_Plan_6b71829c3a.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/f9GMlttRsqc66dOt6VQurFR4i48juAfzCiUaFmOs.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/OCn2152ubIWYsNscRoF5YYxsHbSz1zNbLdTEKCEn.webp"]', 'Park Eden is a luxury residential project in Kharadi, Pune, by Purple Corp (Pride Purple) in association with iDO Realty, marketed as "Real Kharadi". Five towers rise around a central clubhouse and podium amenity level with landscaped gardens, a swimming pool and open activity zones. The towers offer 3 BHK homes (Elite 1,121 sq ft, Prime 1,204 sq ft, Prime+ 1,234 sq ft, Maxima 1,350 sq ft) and 4 BHK Imperia homes of 1,743 sq ft, shown as total carpet area including balconies. All-inclusive packages start at ₹1.99 crore for a 3 BHK and ₹3.33 crore for a 4 BHK. Homes come with 800 x 1600 mm vitrified flooring, a Flexi Room option, chef-ready kitchens with branded hardware, five-star-feel bathrooms with glass cubicles and geysers, a digital door lock with biometric and numeric access, and home automation with voice-control provision. Amenities include a teen zone with arcade gaming, golf simulator and ice hockey, kids zones, a business zone, a banquet hall, gym, swimming pool and kids pool, amphitheatre, jogging and cycling tracks and a sports zone with badminton, squash, padel and net cricket. Gera Commerzone is 2.6 km away, International Tech Park 3.5 km, EON IT Park 3.8 km and the Ahmednagar Highway 2 km. Park Eden Phase I is registered with MahaRERA (PR1260002502005) with a RERA completion date of February 2031.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Ready to Move"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PR1260002502005"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹1.99 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 4 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Kharadi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PR1260002502005", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Kharadi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100062005', 17752, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb4h9-a0m0kn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb586-36pu48.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb6e3-44guac.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb758-91cz1a.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb81a-2y4fen.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb8se-cpce6m.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjeb9m3-c2ixco.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjebag7-3c5qtb.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjebb3r-54dewg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjebbn9-xx0l8.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjebc6b-5jq69o.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/c075f3f3-c6d1-4e1a-a6bf-00961c082c2b/gallery/mvjebcun-b9q8wf.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5539, 73.9331, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1065 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹1.99 Cr"}, {"type": "4 BHK", "carpetArea": "1627 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹3.33 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"question": "Where is Park Eden located?", "answer": "Park Eden is strategically located in prime Kharadi, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Park Eden?", "answer": "Residences in Park Eden start from ₹1.99 Cr - ₹3.33 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Park Eden?", "answer": "Park Eden offers spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Park Eden MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Park Eden is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1260002502005. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Park Eden?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, Jogging Track, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-vtp-velvet-villas', 'VTP Velvet Villas', 'vtp-velvet-villas', 'b-vtp-group', 'Manjari Khurd', '₹6.20 Cr - ₹10.75 Cr', '₹6.20 Cr', '["3 BHK", "5 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6j4n-a981is.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6j4n-a981is.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/LRk6ujgc4OZvne3hIg9Oy1w5Ybq2LhGzE9FyFTTw.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/1676437419434225824.jpg", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1774955181630535411.jpeg"]', 'Velvet Villas by VTP Luxe is an exclusive gated enclave of just 43 independent villas on a 5-acre land parcel inside VTP Realty''s 165+ acre Township Codename Pegasus in New Kharadi, Pune, near WTC and EON IT Park. About an acre is kept as open space. Each villa rises ground + 1 floor with a private top terrace, in three types: Type 1 and Type 2 three-bedroom villas of 2,164 and 2,725 sq ft carpet, and Type 3 five-bedroom villas of 3,670 sq ft carpet, each with its own landscaped front and back gardens and a servant''s room. Interiors feature Italian marble flooring, grand double-height living and dining areas overlooking the front garden, and a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and a skylight above the jacuzzi. The enclave has a palm-lined entry boulevard, a clubhouse with multipurpose hall and indoor gym, a heated swimming pool and children''s pool, a multi-sport court, outdoor gym, children''s play area, barbeque zone, senior citizen plaza and a party lawn with stage, plus multi-tier security and access to township amenities. Holy Angels Convent School is next door, Phoenix Market City and Amanora Mall are about 10 km away and the airport about 11 km. Prices start from ₹6.20 Cr. Agreement possession is December 2026. MahaRERA P52100031829 (Phase 1) and P52100047370 (Phase 2).', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100031829"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹6.20 Cr"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "3 BHK, 5 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Manjari Khurd, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100031829", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Manjari Khurd Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100031829', 28650, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6j4n-a981is.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6joc-o8ntn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6k79-dcb2ed.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6ks8-5kagmi.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6lce-12okfh.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6ly8-795cg1.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6mhc-103t0r.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6n0a-zu4bc.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/9c79e20a-0998-4a0c-8c95-e44548567e67/gallery/mvhz6np0-du3iey.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.523, 73.9756, '[{"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1079 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹6.20 Cr"}, {"type": "5 BHK", "carpetArea": "1573 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹10.75 Cr"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Sports Court", "Swimming Pool", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is VTP Velvet Villas located?", "answer": "VTP Velvet Villas is strategically located in prime Manjari Khurd, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in VTP Velvet Villas?", "answer": "Residences in VTP Velvet Villas start from ₹6.20 Cr - ₹10.75 Cr with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in VTP Velvet Villas?", "answer": "VTP Velvet Villas offers spacious 3 BHK, 5 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is VTP Velvet Villas MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, VTP Velvet Villas is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100031829. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at VTP Velvet Villas?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Sports Court, Swimming Pool, 24x7 Security, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-godrej-aqua-vista', 'Godrej Aqua Vista', 'godrej-aqua-vista', 'b-godrej', 'Mundhwa', '₹85.00 L', '₹85.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'New Launch', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff0lj-11f9n6.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff0lj-11f9n6.webp', 'https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/k0DKtRzvGyo3jMbyF5lDnXQFFY421WAIwDkXgXvJ.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/aMobBGd7Ut8Rx6KGpdkdEhct7heEo0dv5pyVzWik.webp", "https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/base_image/1676437625251825814.jpg"]', 'Godrej Aqua Vista is a riverfront residential development by Godrej Properties in Keshav Nagar, Pune, along the Mula Mutha river, developed with Oxford Group. It is planned across 7 acres with 7 towers, of which about 2.5 acres are given to amenities: 50+ amenities, three clubhouses, two infinity swimming pools, a 300 m riverside promenade and a grand clubhouse of 1,486 sq m. Phase A (Towers 12 to 15) is yet to launch, while Phase B has Towers 16, 17 and 18, with Towers 16 and 17 open for sale. Tower 16 offers 2 BHK homes of 726 to 752 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 974 to 1,240 sq ft (RERA area including exclusive areas), with about 200 apartments and 8 flats per floor. Tower 17 offers 1 and 2 BHK homes, with about 222 apartments and 9 flats per floor. Seasons Mall and Amanora Mall are about 4 km away, EON IT Park 5 km, Magarpatta Cybercity 5.4 km and World Trade Center 5.6 km. The project is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002500389) with a RERA completion date of July 2032. Prices are on request.', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "New Launch"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002500389"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mundhwa, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002500389", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mundhwa Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100060389', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff0lj-11f9n6.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff1h3-geivws.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff2f9-g7clmv.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff33o-9c1423.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff40l-2tj9wk.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff4l2-dunteg.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff5a0-fg0bmd.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff5tb-4o84xi.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff66x-62c8to.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff787-5fll8u.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/73ec855a-b670-4a04-954a-b91deaf3272d/gallery/mvjff7ra-5q1n0a.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 1, 18.5411, 73.9149, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "682 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1111 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}]', '["Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Library", "Sports Court", "Co-working Lounge", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Landscaped Garden"]', '[{"question": "Where is Godrej Aqua Vista located?", "answer": "Godrej Aqua Vista is strategically located in prime Mundhwa, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Godrej Aqua Vista?", "answer": "Residences in Godrej Aqua Vista start from Price on Request with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Godrej Aqua Vista?", "answer": "Godrej Aqua Vista offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Godrej Aqua Vista MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Godrej Aqua Vista is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number PM1260002500389. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Godrej Aqua Vista?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Library, Sports Court, Co-working Lounge, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-vimal-twin-towers', 'Vimal Twin Towers', 'vimal-twin-towers', 'b-kate-promoters-and-developers', 'Pimple Saudagar', '₹85.00 L', '₹85.00 L', '["2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrbu5-6gq1o0.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrbu5-6gq1o0.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-aethereus-high-street-mahalunge-pune/Aethereus_Master_Plan_3b81729c1a.webp', '["https://www.koltepatil.com/assets/uploads/project_floor_plan/16880358561556615257.jpg", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/aJ0jJdFO8iraawNzChzm5yfRSs4FcBR0vdbLakJy.png"]', 'Vimal Twin Towers is a 2 and 3 BHK residential project by Kate Promoters and Developers at S.No. 176/2/1, Shiv Sai Lane, on the Pimple Saudagar and Rahatani border in Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune 411027. The A Wing is a ten-floor building with two lifts, and the master plan also shows a B building and a proposed C building. The developer''s area statement lists 2 BHK homes of 755 sq ft total carpet (about 550 sq ft RERA carpet, plus enclosed balcony and terrace) and 3 BHK homes of 1,033 to 1,043 sq ft total carpet. Listed prices disagree between portals, so the price is on request; please contact the sales team for the current rate card. Amenities include a landscaped garden, children''s play area, jogging track, senior citizen area, party lawn, covered parking, rainwater harvesting, a solar water system and generator backup for common areas. The brochure lists Pimpri about 1 km, Wakad and Nasik Phata about 2 km each, Aundh 3.5 km and Hinjewadi 4 km away. The A Wing is registered with MahaRERA under P52100054177, with possession due by 31 October 2026.', '["Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "P52100054177"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "Price on Request"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Pimple Saudagar, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: P52100054177", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Pimple Saudagar Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100054177', 8200, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrbu5-6gq1o0.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrcmn-c03id9.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/3766f451-d050-4db0-a6f8-194ef4abaa3a/gallery/mvghrdjl-1l5c66.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1fb3b136-50b8-4324-8729-93f941e2b964/gallery/mvu359ei-ccmp4j.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1fb3b136-50b8-4324-8729-93f941e2b964/gallery/mvu359gg-diafvw.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/1fb3b136-50b8-4324-8729-93f941e2b964/gallery/mvu359ib-6z3zc7.webp"]', 4.8, 100, 1, 0, 18.599, 73.7962, '[{"type": "2 BHK", "carpetArea": "740 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}, {"type": "3 BHK", "carpetArea": "1043 sq.ft", "priceRange": "₹85.00 L"}]', '["Rainwater Harvesting", "Jogging Track", "Power Backup", "24x7 Security", "Landscaped Garden", "Covered Parking", "Kids'' Play Area"]', '[{"question": "Where is Vimal Twin Towers located?", "answer": "Vimal Twin Towers is strategically located in prime Pimple Saudagar, Pune, offering seamless connectivity to commercial centers, transit corridors, and essential social infrastructure."}, {"question": "What is the starting price for flats in Vimal Twin Towers?", "answer": "Residences in Vimal Twin Towers start from Price on Request with zero brokerage and direct builder inventory allocation through PROPSMART REALTY."}, {"question": "What unit configurations are available in Vimal Twin Towers?", "answer": "Vimal Twin Towers offers spacious 2 BHK, 3 BHK apartments designed for maximum carpet area efficiency and natural ventilation."}, {"question": "Is Vimal Twin Towers MahaRERA approved?", "answer": "Yes, Vimal Twin Towers is officially registered under MahaRERA with registration number P52100054177. All approvals and certificates are verified."}, {"question": "What amenities are provided at Vimal Twin Towers?", "answer": "The development features world-class lifestyle amenities including Rainwater Harvesting, Jogging Track, Power Backup, 24x7 Security, Landscaped Garden, multi-tier security systems, and high-speed elevators."}]', '');
INSERT INTO projects (id, title, slug, builder_id, location, price_range, exact_price, configurations, status, type, possession_date, image, hero_image, master_layout, floor_plans, description, features, specs, highlights, rera_id, price_per_sqft, verification_status, city, images, rating, reviews_count, is_verified, is_featured, lat, lng, configuration_details, amenities, faqs, brochure_url) VALUES ('p-austin-ira', 'Austin Ira', 'austin-ira', 'b-austin-realty', 'Mamurdi', '₹43.00 L - ₹82.50 L', '₹43.00 L', '["1 BHK", "2 BHK", "3 BHK"]', 'Under Construction', 'Residential', '2027', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem7f5-2fs1d7.webp', 'https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem7f5-2fs1d7.webp', 'https://www.vtprealty.in/images/project/project-details/vtp-aurelia-kharadi-pune/Aurelia_Master_Plan_0a37b12d7c.webp', '["https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/MzzWe9NoesjKW5vXHcTkKqIpofYGW80l6x5m4rGA.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/liv-thumbs/640/uploads/property/CRFwCIeZDlS2wIt2FCjHtVPHQkc9Bh2S4PO5qe0k.webp", "https://keystoneliv.com/public/uploads/property/image - 2026-05-28T164746.759.webp"]', 'Austin Ira is a residential project by Austin Realty in Mamurdi, Pune, spread across 4.5 acres on MCA Road near Mukai Chowk and beside the MCA Pune Stadium. It offers 2 BHK Premium homes of 621 sq ft, 2 BHK Luxury homes of 671 sq ft and 3 BHK Premium homes of 840 sq ft carpet area, along with 1 BHK homes of 450 sq ft, with zero-wastage layouts, large windows for light and cross ventilation, and reserved hill views. More than 50 amenities include a clubhouse, covered swimming pool with pool deck, gymnasium and open gym, multipurpose court, net cricket, jogging track, amphitheatre seating, kids'' and toddler play areas, yoga and meditation zone, indoor games zone, fragrance garden and party lawn. Prices start at ₹65 lakh for a 2 BHK Premium, ₹69 lakh for a 2 BHK Luxury and ₹82.5 lakh for a 3 BHK Premium. Mamurdi sits at the junction of the Mumbai–Pune Expressway and NH-48, about 5 minutes from the expressway, 15 minutes from Hinjawadi and 20 minutes from Baner and Balewadi. Austin Ira is registered with MahaRERA (PM1260002601545) with a RERA completion date of December 2031.', '["CCTV Surveillance", "Clubhouse", "Gymnasium", "Rainwater Harvesting", "Sports Court", "Jogging Track", "Swimming Pool", "Power Backup"]', '[{"label": "Project Status", "value": "Under Construction"}, {"label": "MahaRERA ID", "value": "PM1260002601545"}, {"label": "Direct Starting Price", "value": "₹43 L"}, {"label": "Configurations", "value": "1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK"}, {"label": "Possession Date", "value": "2027"}, {"label": "Micro-Market", "value": "Mamurdi, Pune"}]', '["MahaRERA: PM1260002601545", "0% Brokerage & Direct Builder Booking", "Mamurdi Prime Residential Corridor", "Sanctioned Developer Payment Schedule"]', 'P52100021545', 9555, 'Verified', 'Pune', '["https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem7f5-2fs1d7.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem8cg-5amxai.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjem9bp-bs7eud.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjema5j-cvdnpn.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjemb7g-d5yzvq.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvjemc8j-radvr.webp", "https://punehome.in/storage/v1/object/public/project-media/projects/7209ca11-27c7-4930-b99c-5a1a8035c2a9/gallery/mvje